DESCRIPTION:Join us for the spring 2026 graphic design lecture series. \n\n
 You Are Not the User: Unpacking the Research Process at Lenovo\n\nDana C. G
 ierdowski is a Senior Manager of Product Research on Lenovo’s User Experien
 ce Design Research team. She leads a team of researchers as they collaborat
 e cross-functionally on hardware\, software\, and emerging design products.
  Her previous roles have included nonprofit research in higher education IT
 \, and academic researcher and professor. Dana holds a PhD in Communication
 \, Rhetoric\, and Digital Media from NC State.
