DESCRIPTION:Your website can do more than share information- it can active
 ly enage visitors\, capture leads\, and support customers around the clock
 . In this practical session\, faciliated by Lauri Arnsten of Arts-n-Media\
 , a local creative marketing professional specializing in helping business
 es be seen\, found\, and chosen\, participants will explore easy\, no-code
  tools that bring AI-powered features to life. You'll learn how to add cha
 tbots for customer service\, lead generation\, and basic support- enhancin
 g your website experience without complex development or technical experti
 se. Whether you're looking to streamline communication or create a more in
 teractive online presence\, this session will provide approachable\, real-
 world strategies to get started.
