 clubhouse at The Courtyards at Oak Grove! Step inside a vibrant\, close-kn
 it community thoughtfully designed for effortless\, single-level living. F
 rom private garden courtyards to a low-maintenance lifestyle that lets you
  focus on what matters most\, this is living well\, reimagined. Enjoy ligh
