DESCRIPTION:Mark your calendars for Homeschool Days at the Museum of the Wa
 xhaws!\n\nWednesday\, October 22nd\, 2025 from 10-2\n\n&\n\nWednesday\, Apr
 il 8th\, 2026 from 10-2\n\nTickets will be available for purchase at the fr
 ont desk upon arrival\n\nStudents – $10.00\n\nParents & Chaperones – $5.00\
 n\nChildren 3 & Under – Free\n\nRSVP: Please send us an RSVP with the numbe
 r of students & parents/chaperones you are expecting for the Homeschool Dat
 e via email. (museumofthewaxhaws0@gmail.com)\n\nCloser to the date an email
  will be sent out with the planned living history demonstrations and the pl
 anned craft!\n\nCan’t make it a homeschool day?\n\nNo worries! We also have
  a private field trip option for homeschool families and groups!\n\nIf you 
 have any other questions please feel free to contact us and we can tell you
  all the information about the private field trips! \n\nmuseumofthewaxhaws0
 @gmail.com
