 \, demonstrations and ideas on how you can make our campus and beyond a bet
 ter place.\n\nBring a friend and come experience the breadth of sustainabil
 ity\, including learning about climate\, food\, water\, transportation\, na
 ture\, wellness and so much more. This outdoor event is free\, open to the 
 public and sponsored by NC State’s University Sustainability Office.\n\nNC 
 State student organizations\, departments\, programs and community organiza
 tions are invited to table at this event to boost sustainability awareness 
 and education. Go to the Earth Month webpage to learn more about the fair a
 nd to register to have a table at the fair.
