BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Calendar 1 Ics": "https://calendar.ncsu.edu/event/make-a-noise-box"}
X-SOURCE-ID:calendar_1_ics
X-SOURCE:NC State University
CATEGORIES:Community Events
DESCRIPTION:Come upcycle your way to music stardom by making a noise box. B
 ring a small tin\, such as a mint tin\, and anything that can make an inter
 esting sound\, such as popped guitar strings\, extra screws\, bolts\, etc. 
 You'll learn how to assemble an instrument and use effects in GarageBand to
  expand the musical capability of your unique noise box.
