DESCRIPTION:Join NCSU Dissenters for a night to shed light on the Congo in 
 a holistic way that pushes back against the West's colonial and neocolonial
  narratives about Congo\, its history\, its people and its current genocide
 . The night will feature an engaging talk and presentation from a local Con
 golese community member with decades of experience advocating for the Congo
  at both a grassroots level and at the UN\, as well as food and fundraising
  opportunities for our special guest's nonprofit\, which helps get resource
 s to rural women in the Congo.
