 akes place at The Corner\, an outdoor venue at Main Campus and Research dri
 ves.  The lineup for the six- week concert series is available on the WKNC 
 website. The concert series is free and open to the public. Bring your lunc
 h or grab a bite at one of the food trucks often parked across the street.\
 n\nNC State students interested in performing at Local Lunch Live should em
 ail the WKNC events director at wknc-events@ncsu.edu and include their avai
 lable dates.
