SUMMARY:AI Developer Workshop - Build AI Voice Agents
DESCRIPTION:Triangle Developers\n⚠️ RSVP HERE https://bit.ly/4v8mb9W 
 ⚠️\n\nWe’re excited to partner with AICamp for the hands-on workshop
  for the AI developers in Raleigh on April 9th.\n\nJoin SignalWire and AIC
 amp for a hands-on session to learn building AI Voice Agents\n\nThis works
 hop moves past basic chatbots to focus on the engineering principles of hi
 gh-fidelity\, low-latency voice interaction. We will explore a "Logic-Firs
 t" approach where your code defines the intelligence and conversational fl
 ow\, rather than just managing webhooks and infrastructure.\n\nWhat You’
 ll Build:\n\n* AI voice agents working in production\n* Omnichannel flows 
 with programmable voice and messaging\n* AI Agents with memory and context
  that persist\n* Deployment to production patterns\n\nExpect practical\, r
 eal-world talks from AI builders working deep in production AI systems.\n\
 n* 📅 Date: April 9th\, 2026\n* 🕔 Time: 5:00 PM \\~ 8:00 PM\n* 📍 L
 ocation: Nest Raleigh\n* 👉 RSVP: https://bit.ly/4v8mb9W (Seats are limi
 ted to 50 developers)\n\n**Food and drink are provided. win an iPad 🎁 a
 t the end of the workshop!**\nWe look forward to seeing you there!
