 rgy and productivity. Join the NC State University Libraries during Craftin
 g Recess for a creative break. Whether you're a seasoned crafter or a begin
 ner\, you can unwind and explore your creative side with fun and relaxing h
 ands-on projects. The April 9 Crafting Recess activity will be making shrin
 ky dinks.\n\nCome create\, connect and recharge.
