SUMMARY:Our Schools\, Our Future: Durham Public School Family Gathering
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260409T174500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260409T193000
DTSTAMP:20260407T031319Z
UID:7q5la04k3upn1408i5mn261rhk@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20260409T174500
SEQUENCE:0
CREATED:20260319T191218Z
DESCRIPTION:Join families across Durham who are building a movement to fig
 ht for fully funded\, welcoming public schools. Share a meal\, hear from o
 ther families\, build community\, and learn how we can win real change tog
 ether.\n\nAre you frustrated with what&#39\;s happening in Durham public s
 chools? You&#39\;re not alone.\n\nParents and caregivers from schools acro
 ss Durham are coming together to build the power we need to fight back. At
  this gathering\, you&#39\;ll:\n\n→ Connect with other families who shar
 e your concerns \n→ Hear stories from parents organizing at their school
 s \n→ Learn about the real forces behind the cuts and chaos—and what Y
 OU can do about it \n→ Leave with a clear next step to get involved\n\nC
 hildcare and dinner provided. Bring someone with you—a neighbor\, a frie
 nd\, a co-worker\, another parent from your school!\n\nThis is for anyone 
 who cares about public education: parents\, grandparents\, aunts\, uncles\
 , and community members connected to public schools.\n\nQuestions? Contact
  Courtney at <a href="mailto:Courtney@carolinafederation.org" target="_bla
 nk">Courtney@carolinafederation.org</a>.\n\n<a href="https://www.google.co
 m/url?q=https://www.mobilize.us/carolinafederation/event/878601/&amp\;sa=D
 &amp\;source=calendar&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw0lr7ZciSMxXOuN9Ne8OeLW" ta
 rget="_blank">https://www.mobilize.us/carolinafederation/event/878601/</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260319T191218Z
LOCATION:Holton Career & Resource Center (2nd Floor\, Room 2120)\, 401 N D
 river St\, Durham\, NC 27703\, Durham\, NC\, 27705
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-SOURCE:Durham Resistance (In Person)
END:VEVENT
