X-SOURCE-ID:calendar_1_ics
X-SOURCE:NC State University
CATEGORIES:Community Events
DESCRIPTION:The Women’s Center and the Counseling Center invite NC State co
 mmunity members who self-identify as survivors of sexual assault to join a 
 supportive space for healing and affirmation through art. Counseling Center
  staff will lead a therapeutic\, trauma-informed expressive arts activity a
 nd assist participants in processing their emotions. This group is private 
 and confidential\, so no information will be shared outside of the group. R
 esources will be available to support ongoing healing. Space is limited to 
 10 participants. Please register to reserve your spot.\n\nThis expressive a
 rts activity is part of the university's programming for Sexual Assault Awa
 reness Month.
DTEND:20260409T203000Z
DTSTAMP:20260407T030230Z
DTSTART:20260409T190000Z
GEO:35.784684;-78.675176
LOCATION:Campus Health\, 2301
