BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Calendar 1 Ics": "https://calendar.ncsu.edu/event/id-lecture-david-bulfin-lego"}
X-SOURCE-ID:calendar_1_ics
X-SOURCE:NC State University
CATEGORIES:Lectures and Talks
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an inspiring talk from David Bulfin\, senior design
 er at The LEGO Group. \n\nDavid previously served as the product design dir
 ector at BOLTGROUP\, a globally recognized design-innovation agency that ha
 s called Charlotte home since its inception in 1985. With experience develo
 ping a vast array of international award-winning commercial and consumer pr
 oducts from first sketch to store shelf\, David’s work has influenced a div
 erse set of markets across numerous industries. With a well-honed technical
  aptitude and a knack for advanced development\, David has led successful d
 esign-innovation teams across disciplines and across continents. You might 
 also recognize him from Season 1 of America By Design\, a short-form TV doc
 useries streaming on CBS in the United States.\n\nDavid immigrated to rural
  Denmark in 2022. Today\, he works as a design-innovator with The LEGO Grou
 p at their headquarters in Billund\, helping to create dynamic experiences 
 for builders of all ages. You can see some of his products on shelf at any 
 LEGO retailer in the world. David holds a Bachelor of Industrial Design deg
 ree from NC State.
DTEND:20260409T213000Z
