DESCRIPTION:Get your boogie on when Duck takes the stage for our first LIVE
  at Lake Raleigh concert of the season. This funky\, bluesy\, jazzy band br
 ings the party. Like their T-shirts say\, it’s time for "DUCK\, DUCK\, GROO
 VE." And you’ll be catching them live the night before their new album\, Fu
 nk Prayer\, drops.\n\nThis free\, family-friendly concert series on the pic
 turesque shore of Lake Raleigh is a collaboration between NC State LIVE and
  NC State Centennial and celebrates the unique voices of North Carolina’s e
 xtraordinary music scene. Bring your picnic blankets and enjoy dance-induci
 ng music\, delicious food and an amazing community gathering. The following
  food trucks will be at the concert:\n\nThe Blue Window (Mediterranean)Arep
 a Culture (Latin American)Craft Public House (traditional pub and comfort f
 ood)The gates will open and the food trucks will be on-site at 5 p.m. The c
 oncert will begin at 6 p.m.
