BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Calendar 1 Ics": "https://calendar.ncsu.edu/event/classics-club-joe-goodkin-performance"}
X-SOURCE-ID:calendar_1_ics
X-SOURCE:NC State University
CATEGORIES:Performances
DESCRIPTION:The Classics Club invites you to attend a performance by Chicag
 o-based singer-songwriter Joe Goodkin on Thursday\, April 9\, at 7:45 p.m. 
 at Talley Student Union. Goodkin\, who earned a Bachelor's of Arts in Class
 ics at the University of Wisconsin-Madison\, created The Blues of Achilles\
 , a musical adaptation of The Iliad\, an epic poem by Greek poet Homer. The
  Blues of Achilles is a set of 17 original songs. It tells the story of The
  Iliad through the eyes of its characters: Achilles\, Patroclus\, Briseis\,
  Helen\, Priam and more. The performance evokes the original oral tradition
  of epic bards that stretches back millennia and frames the poem musically 
 and narratively for modern audiences.\n\nThe performance will conclude at 9
  p.m. A Q&A session will follow. Registration is required to attend.\n\nRef
 reshments will be available.
DTEND:20260410T010000Z
DTSTAMP:20260407T030230Z
DTSTART:20260409T234500Z
GEO:35.784114;-78.671321
LOCATION:Talley Student Union\, 3222
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Classics Club: Joe Goodkin Performance 
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_52328554660516
URL:https://calendar.ncsu.edu/event/classics-club-joe-goodkin-performance
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Calendar 1 Ics": "https://calendar.ncsu.edu/event/sexual-assault-awareness-month-denim-installation-4693"}
X-SOURCE-ID:calendar_1_ics
X-SOURCE:NC State University
CATEGORIES:Community Events,Films
DESCRIPTION:Throughout April\, the Women’s Center will have a Denim Day–the
 med installation in the Talley Student Union lobby gallery as part of Sexua
 l Assault Awareness Month. This installation uses denim as a visual symbol 
 of solidarity with survivors and challenges harmful myths and victim-blamin
 g narratives. Visitors can engage with the display as an educational and re
 flective experience\, learning about the history of Denim Day\, the impact 
 of sexual violence and ways to support survivors on campus. The installatio
 n will offer a consistent awareness-raising presence in one of the universi
 ty’s most visible community spaces.
DTSTAMP:20260407T030230Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260410
GEO:35.784114;-78.671321
LOCATION:Talley Student Union
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Sexual Assault Awareness Month Denim Installation
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_52267124624334
URL:https://calendar.ncsu.edu/event/sexual-assault-awareness-month-denim-in
 stallation-4693
END:VEVENT
