DESCRIPTION:Yoga In Nature™\, NC\nALL LEVELS WELCOME. Join us for a viny
 asa flow to yin practice ending in savasana. Join our community and meet o
 ther like-minded people! Yoga heals. Nature heals. Yoga In Nature™.\n\nP
 ractice vinyasa flow to yin yoga at North Carolina Museum of Art\, outdoor
 s near upper parking area in grass ellipse... (NOTE THIS GRASS LOCATION\, 
 as there are other groups that use NCMA grounds). WHEN YOU COME INTO THE P
 ARKING LOT\, DRIVE TO WHERE THE TWO PARKING LOTS ON BLUE RIDGE MEET\, AWAY
  FROM THE MUSEUM. We practice in the grass Ellipse area:)\n$15/person\nCas
 h\nVenmo @Darlene-Genander (0862)\nPaypal dgenander@yogainnature.com\nZell
 e\n\nCome flow with us. Meet others and make friends in our yoga community
 .\nBring a mat\; water\; and anything else you may need for your outdoor y
 oga practice. You may also want an old towel or plastic liner for under yo
 ur mat\, if the grass is damp. Wear layers.\nALL LEVELS WELCOME.
