DESCRIPTION:Help us reach out to low turnout Democrats right here in\nour 
 neighborhood to let them know about the critical NC Supreme Court\nelectio
 n this November. We’ll meet up for some coffee and snacks and talk\nthro
 ugh the game plan before heading out in our neighborhoods to knock on door
 s and lay the groundwork for victory in November.\n\nFirst-time canvassers
  are encouraged to attend\, and everyone will have the opportunity to pair
  up with an experienced partner if they want help heading out on their fir
 st door knocking session. There is a 45-minute training video for first-ti
 me Field Team Justice canvassers that we will send out to registrants so t
 hey can be prepared for a successful canvass!\n\n<a href="https://www.goog
 le.com/url?q=https://www.mobilize.us/durhamcountydemocrats/event/916319/&a
 mp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw0xfDgHPxtXmgkUmkPu
 Why9" target="_blank">https://www.mobilize.us/durhamcountydemocrats/event/
 916319/</a>
