X-SOURCE-ID:calendar_1_ics
X-SOURCE:NC State University
CATEGORIES:Community Events,Fundraiser
DESCRIPTION:It's that time of year again for one of the longest-running pla
 nt sales in our area. Members of the NC State Pi Alpha Xi (PAX) horticultur
 e honors society are pleased to invite you to our spring plant sale\, featu
 ring a wide selection of trees\, shrubs\, perennials\, annuals\, houseplant
 s and more. Be sure to look at the list of plants that will be for sale. Th
 e three-day plant sale will take place on the following days and times.\n\n
 Pre-sale hours: Friday\, April 10\, 5-6 p.m. You must pay a $25 presale fee
  at checkout.\nWeekend sale hours: Saturday\, April 11\, 8 a.m.-4 p.m. and 
 Sunday\, April 12\, 10 a.m.-3 p.m.\n\nAll profits will be donated to hortic
 ultural nonprofits in the community and towards scholarships. You can parti
 cipate in a plant raffle to raise funds for a memorial scholarship in honor
  and remembrance of fellow PAX member and NC State Department of Horticultu
 ral Sciences alumnus Will Hembree.
DTEND:20260411T200000Z
DTSTAMP:20260407T030230Z
DTSTART:20260411T120000Z
