BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Events 1 Ics": "https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/spring-garden-lovers-weekend"}
X-SOURCE-ID:events_1_ics
X-SOURCE:NC Cultural Resources
CATEGORIES:Exhibits & Tours,Guided Tours,Special Site Programs
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Spring with FREE GARDEN ADMITTANCE during Garden Love
 rs’ Weekend!\n\nThe Tryon Palace Gardens will be free and open to the publi
 c on Friday from 9 a.m. to 6 p.m.\; Saturday from 9 a.m. to 6 p.m.\; and Su
 nday from noon to 6 p.m.\n\nAs part of Arts in April\, on Saturday and Sund
 ay\, you can enjoy watching plein air artists paint in the gardens. In addi
 tion\, on Saturday the Craven Consort woodwind group will be performing und
 er the Palace colonnades. This five-piece woodwind group performs pieces fr
 om the 17th and 18th centuries on period instruments. Be sure to stop by an
 d enjoy their performance.\n\nEnjoy a variety of spring blooming plants\, i
