DESCRIPTION:The Marbles Backwards Science Fair is a new twist on the tradit
 ional science fair. In our version of a science fair\, kids get to be the j
 udges as scientists and engineers from NC State University compete for the 
 coolest science experiment. Come meet real-life researchers\, learn about t
 heir work and choose your favorite science project. During your afternoon a
 t the science fair\, stop by the Learning is Fun table\, presented by event
  sponsor the NC State University Libraries\, for some fun activities.  This
  event promises to be enjoyable for kids and parents of all ages.\n\nMarble
 s Kids Museum and NC State's Office of University Interdisciplinary Program
 s jointly organize this annual event.
