DESCRIPTION:A special celebration of our Nations 250th\, dedication ceremon
 y and unveiling of The America 205! Revolutionary War Patriots Marker on Ap
 ril 11\, 2026 at 2 p.m. Location: Third Creek Presbyterian Church Cemetery\
 , 2055 3rd Creek Church Road\, Cleveland\, NC  This will be a historic cele
 bration of our Nation's 250th Birthday\, Patriotism honoring those involved
  in our freedom and educational in giving facts about the people and times 
 during the Revolutionary War.  Seating is limited\, so bring your own chair
  if needed. RSVP by March 11\, 2026 to d.d14@aol.com
DTEND:20260411T200000Z
