BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Events 1 Ics": "https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/halifax-day-250th-celebration-concert-drone-show"}
X-SOURCE-ID:events_1_ics
X-SOURCE:NC Cultural Resources
CATEGORIES:Performances & Arts,Concerts (Music),Celebrations & Commemoratio
 ns,Ceremonies & Anniversaries
DESCRIPTION:2026 is the 250th Anniversary of both the Halifax Resolves & De
 claration of Independence\, so mark your calendars to join us on Sunday\, A
 pril 12th in Downtown Halifax for this year's celebration!\n\nThroughout th
 e day\, the Historic site's newly renovated Visitor's Center will be open f
 rom 10am-5pm. There will be historic building tours\, a Continental Army en
 campment & market\, living history demonstrations at the Bradford-Denton Ho
 use\, as well as tours of the Royal White-Hart Masonic Lodge\, demonstratio
 ns of tar pitch & turpentine at the Edward Cheek House\, self-guided tours 
 of the Underground Railroad Trail\, & special ceremonies.\n\nWe'll have foo
 d trucks on site for lunch & dinner\, Two Doors Down will have a lunch opti
 on available on the Wilcox House lawn from Noon-3pm\, Halifax Fire & Rescue
  will be selling BBQ for dinner\, & The Trophy Room will be serving up drin
 ks all day\, plus cornhole & giant Jenga for the evening!\n\nThe Bass House
  will be open for shoppers & there will be a vendor market inside The Hen &
  The Hog from Noon-5pm.\n\nThis year\, we will also have THREE fun photo op
 portunities! Local artist Riley Mills will be installing a mural on site fo
 r the weekend & Triangle Twirl will be bringing two photobooth options for 
 guests to enjoy starting at 4:30pm.\n\nThe first photobooth will be an inte
 ractive experience capturing fun 360 degree slow-motion videos of our guest
 s! This one holds up to SEVEN people\, comes with themed colonial props\, &
  will be located inside the mural park on King Street. The second will be a
  roaming photographer using AI to transform your image into a revolutionary
  soldier\, lady of the day\, or drum & fife musician. Both are free to the 
 public & participants will receive their images instantly to post on social
  media!⃣ #halifaxday\n\nAt 5pm our MC & DJ for the evening\, radio host of 
 Friday Beach Blast with Andy Lucy\, will kick things off with the first hou
 r of music\, followed by our headliner the Band Of Oz at 6pm\, then Sky Ele
 ments will be putting on a custom Patriotic DRONE SHOW for us at dark honor
 ing the Halifax Resolves!\n\nChairs & blankets welcome! No coolers or outsi
 de alcohol\, please.
DTEND:20260413T010000Z
DTSTAMP:20260407T030452Z
DTSTART:20260412T203000Z
GEO:36.321529;-77.593133
LOCATION:Downtown Halifax
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Halifax Day 250th Celebration - Concert & Drone Show
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_52391275681792
URL:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/halifax-day-250th-celebration-concert-
 drone-show
END:VEVENT
