DESCRIPTION:SIGN UP HERE: <br><a href="https://us06web.zoom.us/webinar/re
 gister/WN_jO0FSE52T92dNuWbBofZvg#/registration">https://us06web.zoom.us/we
 binar/register/WN_jO0FSE52T92dNuWbBofZvg#/registration</a><br><br>Join us 
 for a conversation with members of the Families Together team as we walk t
 hrough how our community comes together to support families navigating hom
 elessness.From the moment a family is referred to Families Together\, staf
 f\, volunteers\, and supporters work together to create safe spaces and ne
 w opportunities for stability.Emergency Shelter Specialist Faith Godfrey\,
  Property Strategy Manager Kenneth Nixon\, and Volunteer and Outreach Coor
 dinator Lucy Jones will share how their work intersects—from welcoming f
 amilies into shelter\, to preparing safe and well-maintained homes\, to mo
 bilizing volunteers and community partners who provide the essentials that
  help families rebuild.Hear the real stories behind the work—and learn h
 ow our community comes together to make stability possible for more famili
 es every day.
