BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Calendar 1 Ics": "https://calendar.ncsu.edu/event/2026-one-health-research-symposium"}
X-SOURCE-ID:calendar_1_ics
X-SOURCE:NC State University
CATEGORIES:Meetings and Conferences
DESCRIPTION:Join the Global One Health Academy for its third annual One Hea
 lth Research Symposium. This half-day event will spark excitement and spur 
 conversation and new collaborations around One Health\, a framework that re
 cognizes the interconnected nature of plant\, animal\, human and environmen
 tal health. Faculty\, staff\, students and members of the public can attend
  this celebration of One Health research and leadership at NC State. The sy
 mposium will feature:\n\nA keynote presentation from Tony Goldberg (Univers
 ity of Wisconsin-Madison)Research talks from the 2025-26 Global One Health 
 FellowsAn engaging panel discussion on topics at the food-water interfaceRe
 search sharing opportunities\, including a poster session and paper of the 
 year awardBe sure to stay afterwards for a one-hour reception with refreshm
 ents and plenty of networking.
DTEND:20260414T210000Z
DTSTAMP:20260407T030230Z
DTSTART:20260414T170000Z
GEO:35.784114;-78.671321
LOCATION:Talley Student Union\, Coastal Ballroom
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:2026 One Health Research Symposium
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_49949524453484
URL:https://calendar.ncsu.edu/event/2026-one-health-research-symposium
END:VEVENT
