DESCRIPTION:<br><br><br><br><br><br>  <p>Flip NC</p><p>Join us for a lit d
 rop party and happy hour meet up in Durham! We'll meet up at 6pm at a Durh
 am location TBD for pizza (on us!) and drinks\, distribute materials and l
 it drop information\, and head out to drop lit for about an hour. Then we'
 ll meet back up after for drinks.</p><p>Volunteers will have the option to
  go out in pairs or on their own. Sign up a friend to join you\, or we'll 
 pair you up when you arrive.</p><p>For this voter outreach event\, we're l
 eaving informational flyers at targeted\, left-leaning voters' doors to sp
 read the word about the right-wing takeover of our state courts and the im
 portance of voting the full ballot in November.</p><p><a href="https://www
 .mobilize.us/flipnc/event/913619/">Sign up here!</a> Note: Advance sign-up
  is needed so we know how many flyers and voter lists to prepare.</p><p>Ho
 pe to see you there!</p>    <br><br><a href="https://flipnc.org/events/202
 6/4/14durham-lit-drop-party">https://flipnc.org/events/2026/4/14durham-lit
 -drop-party</a>
