CATEGORIES:Community Events
DESCRIPTION:Take a break from your weekly grind and come enjoy the JC Rauls
 ton Arboretum after work during its Evening Garden Stroll. You can wander t
 he gardens at your own pace or go on the free public tour led by our volunt
 eer tour guides. To join the tour\, meet at the Bobby G. Wilder Visitor Cen
 ter at 6 p.m. On Evening Garden Stroll nights\, the arboretum's gardens rem
 ain open until 7:30 p.m.
