DESCRIPTION:NC Democrats\n \nIt's time to find all the warriors for justi
 ce!\n\nBuilding power starts with engaging our neighbors. Join fierce fema
 le activists from across the land\, Young Democrats\, and friendly neighbo
 rs on Wednesday evenings from 6-8pm at NCDP Headquarters in Raleigh or on 
 Zoom (link sent in confirmation email after you sign up) to call friendly 
 Democrats to talk about making a plan to vote in the 2026 midterm election
 s and invite them to upcoming events.\n\nThank you for stepping up! No exp
 erience necessary. You’ll get all the training you need when we meet. If
  you join us in-person\, we have snacks and refreshing beverages. Join us 
 to create a closer community and a bluer North Carolina!\n\nHow to prepare
 :\nHi Friend\,\n\nThank you for signing up for our phone bank! For the bes
 t experience\, we recommend bringing a  laptop\, desktop\, or a tablet dev
 ice to our phone bank. A cell phone is not recommended for a user-friendly
  experience but can be used if necessary. \n\nHere is the Zoom link: \nhtt
 ps://us02web.zoom.us/j/84409850441\n\nStart preparing now for the phone ba
 nk by viewing this [helpful YouTube video](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v
 =BU6CPwwWTV4).\n\nProblems with setting up your ActionID? Here's a [tip sh
 eet](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1PGnpjTn1A0KCm15aNUgKGSkON6BXrEE6U
 Gfmienr-1A/edit?usp=sharing).\n\nWe look forward to meeting you!\n\nSee yo
 u soon\, \nNC Dems Organizing Team\n\nhttps://www.mobilize.us/ncdems/event
 /760795/
LAST-MODIFIED:20260226T223857Z
LOCATION:NCDP Headquarters\, 220 Hillsborough St\, Raleigh\, NC\, 27603
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-SOURCE:Durham Resistance (Virtual NC)
END:VEVENT
