SUMMARY:April Banned Book Club: Everyone Is Lying to You by Jo Piazza
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260415T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260415T210000
DTSTAMP:20260407T031320Z
UID:7637h0me3scblke24e2u185r8q@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20260415T193000
SEQUENCE:0
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260401T155311Z
DESCRIPTION:Author Jo Piazza is joining our April Banned Book Club for a c
 onversation about her novel\, Everyone Is Lying to You. Her book pulls bac
 k the curtain on the lives of ‘trad wives\,’ curated perfection\, and 
 the dark secrets behind seemingly perfect lives. We’ll discuss the trad 
 wife movement in our country\, who these women really are\, and what’s d
 riving the trend. Jo will also share why she wrote the book and how it cha
 llenges myths about modern femininity\, domestic ideals\, and the cost of 
 living up to an image.\n\nSee you there! https://redwine-blue.zoom.us/meet
 ing/register/XfThhmifTAKA5DZMoKi1Gg
LAST-MODIFIED:20260401T155311Z
LOCATION:Virtual
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-SOURCE:Durham Resistance (Virtual US)
