DESCRIPTION:Step away from the stresses of daily life and into the calming 
 embrace of nature as Shawn Ramsey\, a certified forest therapy guide\, lead
 s a two-hour guided forest bathing experience. The experience will encourag
 e you to slow down\, awaken your senses and reconnect with the natural worl
 d in a meaningful way. Inspired by the Japanese practice of shinrin-yoku an
 d supported by growing scientific research\, forest bathing promotes relaxa
 tion\, improved mood and enhanced well-being.
