X-SOURCE-ID:events_1_ics
X-SOURCE:NC Cultural Resources
CATEGORIES:Education Programs,Exhibits & Tours,Guided Tours
DESCRIPTION:Discover Tryon Palace in a whole new way! Are you ready to unco
 ver the untold story of how North Carolina helped turn the tide of the Amer
 ican Revolution? \n\n“Discovering Tryon Palace: Caswell’s Capital” goes bey
 ond the standard Palace tour\, exploring in depth North Carolina’s pivotal 
 role in winning independence from Great Britain and showcases Tryon Palace 
 as the first state capitol—a symbol of resilience and leadership during Ame
 rica’s fight for liberty.\n\nJoin us and experience a new facet of our nati
 on’s Revolutionary story. Discover the people\, the decisions\, and the leg
 acy that shaped a nation.\n\nAn America 250 program.\n\nTickets: Adults $20
  (plus tax)\; Youth ages 6-14 $15 (plus tax).
DTEND:20260416T203000Z
DTSTAMP:20260407T030452Z
DTSTART:20260416T193000Z
