DESCRIPTION:Workplace dynamics can be challenging and understanding your co
 mmunication style is key to navigating those dynamics effectively.   The Ac
 celerate to Industry+ (A2i+) program will host a workshop that will help pa
 rticipants identify how their style influences interactions with supervisor
 s\, peers and collaborators. Through practical strategies and real-world sc
 enarios\, students will practice approaches for resolving conflict and comm
 unicating with clarity and confidence. Attendees will leave with tools they
  can apply immediately in their current roles and future careers.
