DESCRIPTION:The College of Humanities and Social Sciences will showcase the
  high-impact experiences CHASS undergraduate students have participated in 
 over the past year. CHASS students will present projects from categories in
 cluding traditional research projects\, student organizational leadership\,
  community-based volunteer projects and study abroad experiences.  Come lea
 rn more and celebrate the work our departments and campus partners are doin
 g to positively impact the CHASS student experience.\n\nRegistration will b
 egin at 9 a.m. Student presentations will start at 9:30 a.m. and end at noo
 n. A networking reception will follow.
