 ty at the JC Raulston Arboretum as we welcome Brent Heath of Brent & Becky'
 s for a special program devoted to the art and impact of flowering bulbs.\n
 \nThis immersive experience pairs an inspiring lecture with a hands-on work
 shop\, offering practical guidance on weaving gorgeous\, durable flowering 
 bulbs into your landscape. You'll create a summer-flowering container to ta
 ke home as your own living expression of everything you learn.
