X-SOURCE-ID:calendar_1_ics
X-SOURCE:NC State University
CATEGORIES:Exhibitions
DESCRIPTION:Join the NC State University Libraries to celebrate the opening
  of the newest student-curated exhibit in the Special Collections Exhibit G
 allery. Come learn about the development of natural history as reflected in
  the Special Collections Research Center's Rare Books Collection. The exhib
 it traces scientific knowledge and printing technology and considers who di
 d the work of natural history. The celebration will open with remarks from 
 Libraries staff and the exhibit’s student curator\, Karina Burbank. Light r
 efreshments will be provided.
DTEND:20260417T193000Z
DTSTAMP:20260407T030231Z
DTSTART:20260417T173000Z
GEO:35.787562;-78.669711
LOCATION:D.H. Hill Jr. Library\, Exhibit Gallery
