DESCRIPTION:Explore the Historic Occoneechee Speedway through an artistic l
 ens\, even if you are not an artist! We will be using watercolor pencils an
 d river water to activate them. We have supplies but you are welcome to bri
 ng your own. Registration required.\n\nAll children must be accompanied by 
 an adult. Please be sure to dress appropriately for the weather\, wear hiki
 ng shoes\, and bring water! Camping chair or sitting pad recommended.\n\nSp
 aces are limited\, and registration is required. To sign up\, call (984) 25
 0-1370 or email eno.river@ncparks.gov. Include the number of guests in your
  party and a phone number where you can be reached if the event is changed 
 or canceled.
