BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-ID:gcal_enoriver_org_9u7o786v1jlk6heq5cp3k1gr1k
SUMMARY:ERA - Guided Forest Therapy Hike - Confluence Natural Area
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260418T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260418T120000
DTSTAMP:20260407T031316Z
UID:0uteeq7odkmkitbr1nt094jtje@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20260418T100000
SEQUENCE:0
CREATED:20260301T140037Z
DESCRIPTION:<p><u><u><a href="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/1984194954522?a
 ff=oddtdtcreator" target="_blank">Registration is required</a></u></u> - 
 Tickets drop on March 1st at 8:00am!<br>Price: $4<br>*Ticket prices direct
 ly support the work of the Eno River Association. Thank you for your suppo
 rt!</p><p><br></p><p>Forest Therapy (sometimes known as Forest Bathing or 
 Shinrin-Yoku) broadly means <strong><strong>taking in the forest atmospher
 e with all of one's senses</strong></strong>. Not simply a walk in the woo
 ds\; it is the conscious and contemplative practice of being immersed in t
 he sights\, sounds\, and smells of the forest. During your walk\, Aimee Va
 ndemark will guide you through invitations to awaken your senses\, slow do
 wn\, be present\, and reconnect with the nature and rhythm of your surroun
 dings.</p><p><br></p><p>Meet at the pavilion beside the parking lot. This 
 hike will take approximately two hours (sometimes less\, sometimes more). 
 Please feel free to bring water and snacks. Wear comfortable\, weather-app
 ropriate clothing and shoes. Well-behaved dogs are welcome as long as they
  are under your control and on a 6-foot leash. Restrooms are available on-
 site.</p><p><br></p><p>The address is 4214 Highland Farm Rd\, Hillsborough
 \, NC 27278.</p><p>From Hillsborough take Hwy 86 North away from town 1.6 
 miles from US70. Turn left on Coleman Loop 1.1 miles. Turn left on Highlan
 d Farm Rd 2.4 miles. The Confluence is on the left. There is a large sign 
 and a gravel driveway. From northern Orange County take Hwy 86 south after
  passing Walnut Grove Church Rd take the first right on Kenion Rd 1.7 mile
 s. Turn right on Highland Farm Rd 0.6 miles. The Confluence is on the left
 . There is a large sign and a gravel driveway.</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260301T140037Z
LOCATION:4214 Highland Farm Rd\, Hillsborough\, NC 27278\, USA
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
X-SOURCE:Eno River Association
END:VEVENT
