DESCRIPTION:The Jenkins MBA program invites prospective students to campus 
 for a live session of one of our PACKed Saturday courses. This is a unique 
 opportunity to experience our classroom environment firsthand\, connect wit
 h MBA students and faculty and gain valuable insight into the Jenkins commu
 nity.\n\n\n\nChoose between the following class options on the registration
  form. Space is limited:\n\n\n\nMBA 551: Predictive Analytics for Business 
 and Big Data (Donnie Hale)MBA 590: Influencing Others (Roger Mayer)\n\nHere
  is the class visit schedule:\n\n\n\n8 a.m.\nMeet at Nelson Hall. Complimen
 tary parking is available in the nearby Dan Allen Parking Deck\, just a sho
 rt walk away. Breakfast is provided. \n\n\n\n8:30 a.m.\nClass begins.\n\n\n
 \n10:30 a.m.\nThe class concludes. Stick around to chat with our admissions
  team and students who will be available to answer your questions.
