X-SOURCE:NC Cultural Resources
CATEGORIES:Outdoor & Recreation,Statewide Clean Up
DESCRIPTION:McDowell County Center's Keep McDowell Beautiful program\, in p
 artnership with the McDowell 250 Committee\, will be hosting a clean-up of 
 the Catawba River on Saturday\, April 18th\, from 9 a.m. until noon.\n\nWe 
 will have a volunteer check-in and trash drop-off at Greenlee Park. All cle
 an-up supplies\, including gloves\, trash bags\, trash grabbers\, and safet
 y vests\, will be provided to volunteers. Contact Matt Burneisen at Matt_Bu
 rneisen@ncsu.edu or (828) 652-8104 if you have questions or would like to r
 egister a group.\n\n4/18/2026 \n\n9 am- 12 pm\n\nGreenlee Park\, Marion\, N
 C\n\n1212 Old Greenlee Road\, Marion\, NC 28752
DTEND:20260418T160000Z
DTSTAMP:20260407T030452Z
DTSTART:20260418T130000Z
GEO:35.687358;-82.048654
LOCATION:Greenlee Park 
