DESCRIPTION:Join us for a guided walk through the Park that focuses on the 
 healing power of nature and being outside. During this slow-paced and medit
 ative walk\, connect with the natural world\, yourself\, and each other thr
 ough guided meditation and sensory explorations that provide opportunities 
 for calm and restoration. \n\nAges 12 and up. Space is limited\, and prereg
 istration is required. This tour is offered in the spring and fall each yea
 r\, weather permitting.
