BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Events 1 Ics": "https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/voices-from-the-past-celebrating-america250-nc"}
X-SOURCE-ID:events_1_ics
X-SOURCE:NC Cultural Resources
CATEGORIES:Celebrations & Commemorations,Reenactments & Living History
DESCRIPTION:How are you celebrating AMERICA250NC?\nStep into history with a
  spirited stroll through Charlotte’s past.\n \n VOICES FROM THE PAST is a u
 nique living history event that invites guests to explore Charlotte’s histo
 ric cemeteries\, Settlers'\, Elmwood\, and Pinewood. Along the way\, you’ll
  meet 25 costumed storytellers who bring history to life\, sharing the amaz
 ing stories of the men and women who helped make Charlotte into what it is 
 today.\n\n VOICES FROM THE PAST is not a guided tour. It is a living histor
 y event unlike anything you've ever been to.  The storytellers are at the g
 rave of the person they are portraying. Visitors will interact with the por
 trayers as they stroll from one to another at their own pace.\n\nAMERICA250
   NC will be spotlighted throughout the day with "milestones" of Charlotte'
 s history beginning with its Declaration of Independence on May 20\, 1775.\
 n \n\nVOICES FROM THE PAST is where Charlotte's 250-year history comes aliv
 e for the day\, one story at a time. Whether you are a Charlotte native or 
 new to the city\, you will learn enjoy hearing the stories. And\, we promis
 e that before the end of the day\, you will say\, "WOW\, I didn't know that
 "!\n\n This year\, we have the honor of her Majesty Queen Charlotte helping
  us celebrate this special anniversary. Bring your cameras for a selfie wit
 h the Queen!
DTEND:20260418T200000Z
DTSTAMP:20260407T030452Z
DTSTART:20260418T170000Z
GEO:35.235335;-80.847966
LOCATION:Historic Elmwood Pinewood Cemetery
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:VOICES FROM THE PAST - Celebrating AMERICA250 NC
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_52448129630815
URL:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/voices-from-the-past-celebrating-ameri
 ca250-nc
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Events 1 Ics": "https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/america250-guilford-time-capsule-celebration"}
X-SOURCE-ID:events_1_ics
X-SOURCE:NC Cultural Resources
CATEGORIES:Celebrations & Commemorations
DESCRIPTION:Don’t miss your chance to be part of history!\n\nWe’re hosting 
 a dedication celebration for the America250 Guilford County Time Capsule!\n
 \nSaturday\, April 18\n\n2:00 pm – 4:00 pm\n\nHigh Point Museum\n\n \n\nThe
  event will include the dedication ceremony\, an artifact display\, light r
 efreshments\, family activities\, reenactors\, and more.\n\nArtifacts will 
 be held in the High Point Historical Society Collections at the High Point 
 Museum to be opened in 2076.\n\n \n\nWe are collecting artifacts through th
 e end of the year for potential inclusion. If you have a donation for consi
 deration\, please fill out the form at: america250guilford.com/time-capsule
 -donations/\n\nFor questions about the event or donations\, please visit th
 e High Point Museum or America250 Guilford’s websites.
DTEND:20260418T200000Z
DTSTAMP:20260407T030452Z
DTSTART:20260418T180000Z
GEO:35.979741;-79.992174
LOCATION:High Point Museum
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:America250 Guilford Time Capsule Celebration
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_52266027191412
URL:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/america250-guilford-time-capsule-celeb
 ration
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Events 1 Ics": "https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/time-capsule-dedication-ceremony-america250-guilford-county"}
X-SOURCE-ID:events_1_ics
X-SOURCE:NC Cultural Resources
CATEGORIES:Celebrations & Commemorations,Ceremonies & Anniversaries
DESCRIPTION:Don’t miss your chance to be part of history! The America 250 G
 uilford County Time Capsule will be ceremonially sealed at the High Point M
 useum. Join us for this special event featuring live music and a rare oppor
 tunity to view the items before they’re sealed away until America’s 300th a
 nniversary. This FREE ceremony is open to the public
