DESCRIPTION:Come enjoy an evening of exceptional jazz as the NC State Jazz 
 Orchestra and the Cates Avenue Jazz Combo take the stage. These groups will
  showcase a wide variety of repertoire\, ranging from established big band 
 masterpieces to cutting-edge contemporary combo arrangements. This performa
 nce will highlight the dedication and creative artistry of our most skilled
  musicians. If you want to experience the joy and excitement of a fantastic
  night of jazz\, this is a performance you won't want to miss.\n\nTickets g
 o on sale Monday\, Feb. 16.
