BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Ncwf": "https://ncwf.org/event/alligator-river-wildlife-paddle-manns-harbor/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:ncwf
X-SOURCE:NC Wildlife Federation
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260419T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260419T120000
DTSTAMP:20260406T231202
CREATED:20260317T180407Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260317T180407Z
UID:10001536-1776592800-1776600000@ncwf.org
SUMMARY:Alligator River Wildlife Paddle (Manns Harbor)
DESCRIPTION:Join NCWF’s Wildlife Habitat Stewards of Northeastern NC Chapter and Coastal Kayak for a guided paddle through Alligator River National Wildlife Refuge on Sunday\, April19\, from 10 a.m. to 12 p.m. As you glide through the calm refuge waters\, keep an eye out for alligators\, river otters\, and a wide variety of birds and other species enjoying their natural habitats. \nEstablished in 1984\, the refuge protects the rare pocosin wetlands\, unique ecosystems built on deep peat soils and covered with low\, shrubby vegetation. The area also includes swamp forest and is bordered by rich marshland. This vast protected landscape supports thriving populations of black bears and wintering waterfowl\, and it’s one of the only places in the world where you might spot endangered Red Wolves in the wild. \nEnjoy this unforgettable two-hour adventure for just $45 per person\, which includes experienced guides\, a kayak\, and all necessary gear. Both single and double kayaks are available. \n**After you register here\, you’ll receive a confirmation email with a link for payment and reservation of your kayak with Coastal Kayak.**\n\n 
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/alligator-river-wildlife-paddle-manns-harbor/
CATEGORIES:Featured
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://ncwf.org/wp-content/uploads/alligatorriverpaddle.jpg
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Events 1 Ics": "https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/elk-knob-state-park-curious-minds-adventure-scavenger-hunt"}
X-SOURCE-ID:events_1_ics
X-SOURCE:NC Cultural Resources
CATEGORIES:Education Programs,Homeschool & Education Days,Exhibits & Tours,
 Special Site Programs,Outdoor & Recreation,Outdoor Recreation (kayak, paddl
 e, hikes),Nature & Wildlife Programs,Youth & Family Activities
DESCRIPTION:Join the Curious Minds Adventure Scavenger Hunt at Elk Knob Sta
 te Park. Journey through northern hardwood forest\, follow winding mountain
  trails\, and explore the unique ecosystems of this high-elevation park. Ke
 ep your eyes open—what signs of wildlife or weather-shaped landscapes will 
 you uncover? Look for unique rocks that make Elk Knob a very special clue i
 n North Carolina’s geologic history. Start at the Visitor Center and scan t
 he QR code in your Actionbound app. Flyers with the QR code will be placed 
 in the Park Office and on all park map kiosks. \n\nThe adventures are avail
 able on the Actionbound app – a free download to your cellphone through you
 r phone’s app store. There’s no need to create a profile and no personal da
 ta is collected with Actionbound. You simply find new hunts by searching fo
 r the park name or scanning the associated QR code posted for your park’s a
 dventure.\n\nThis program is made possible through a partnership with the N
 C Science Trail (ncsciencetrail.org)! Visit their website for more Curious 
 Minds Adventure Scavenger Hunts being held in other NC State Parks and for 
 other programs being offered throughout the state. \n\nThis scavenger hunt 
 is running now through April 30\, 2026.
DTEND:20260420T000000Z
DTSTAMP:20260407T030452Z
DTSTART:20260419T110000Z
GEO:36.333462;-81.696432
LOCATION:Elk Knob State Park
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Elk Knob State Park: Curious Minds Adventure Scavenger Hunt
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_52374989503111
URL:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/elk-knob-state-park-curious-minds-adve
 nture-scavenger-hunt
END:VEVENT
