X-SOURCE-ID:calendar_1_ics
X-SOURCE:NC State University
CATEGORIES:
DESCRIPTION:Step away from the stresses of daily life and into the calming 
 embrace of nature as Shawn Ramsey\, a certified forest therapy guide\, lead
 s a two-hour guided forest bathing experience. The experience will encourag
 e you to slow down\, awaken your senses and reconnect with the natural worl
 d in a meaningful way. Inspired by the Japanese practice of shinrin-yoku an
 d supported by growing scientific research\, forest bathing promotes relaxa
 tion\, improved mood and enhanced well-being.\n\nAs you meander through the
  natural areas of the JC Raulston Arboretum\, you’ll be gently guided throu
 gh a series of mindfulness practices and nature-based invitations designed 
 to foster presence\, curiosity and a deeper sense of connection.
DTEND:20260419T160000Z
DTSTAMP:20260407T030231Z
DTSTART:20260419T140000Z
GEO:35.794251;-78.699671
LOCATION:JC Raulston Arboretum
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Forest Bathing: A Guided Journey Into Nature's Wisdom
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_52497895151305
URL:https://calendar.ncsu.edu/event/forest-bathing-a-guided-journey-into-na
 tures-wisdom-9075
END:VEVENT
