 izens at particular risk. This session will equip participants to train ot
 hers on core Know Your Rights topics such as the right to remain silent\, 
 the right to refuse to consent to searches\, and the right to record ICE a
 nd other law enforcement officials. We will also cover best practices for 
 reducing risks when exercising rights.\n\nJoin from PC\, Mac\, iPad\, or A
 ndroid:\n<a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://indivisible.zoom.us
