BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Calendar 1 Ics": "https://calendar.ncsu.edu/event/the-art-and-science-of-plant-care"}
X-SOURCE-ID:calendar_1_ics
X-SOURCE:NC State University
CATEGORIES:Community Events
DESCRIPTION:Caring for plants is both an art and a science — part intuition
 \, part know-how. Every gardener\, from beginner to expert\, faces the same
  essential questions: When should I prune? How much should I water? What’s 
 the best way to plant\, fertilize or repot? In this class\, Bryce Lane will
  bring decades of horticultural expertise to demystify these everyday tasks
 \, showing you not just what to do but why it works.\n\nOver eight weeks\, 
 you’ll explore the fundamental practices that keep gardens thriving\, learn
 ing how to perform each one with confidence and purpose. You’ll uncover the
  science behind good technique — understanding how soil\, water\, nutrients
  and plant biology interact — while also developing the practical judgment 
 that comes only with experience.\n\nEach session will focus on one key aspe
 ct of plant care\, building a complete toolkit for growing healthier\, more
  resilient plants in any garden setting.
DTEND:20260421T003000Z
DTSTAMP:20260407T030231Z
DTSTART:20260420T223000Z
GEO:35.794251;-78.699671
LOCATION:JC Raulston Arboretum
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:The Art and Science of Plant Care
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_52072165586806
URL:https://calendar.ncsu.edu/event/the-art-and-science-of-plant-care
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Calendar 1 Ics": "https://calendar.ncsu.edu/event/sexual-assault-awareness-month-denim-installation-4693"}
X-SOURCE-ID:calendar_1_ics
X-SOURCE:NC State University
CATEGORIES:Community Events,Films
DESCRIPTION:Throughout April\, the Women’s Center will have a Denim Day–the
 med installation in the Talley Student Union lobby gallery as part of Sexua
 l Assault Awareness Month. This installation uses denim as a visual symbol 
 of solidarity with survivors and challenges harmful myths and victim-blamin
 g narratives. Visitors can engage with the display as an educational and re
 flective experience\, learning about the history of Denim Day\, the impact 
 of sexual violence and ways to support survivors on campus. The installatio
 n will offer a consistent awareness-raising presence in one of the universi
 ty’s most visible community spaces.
DTSTAMP:20260407T030231Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260421
GEO:35.784114;-78.671321
LOCATION:Talley Student Union
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Sexual Assault Awareness Month Denim Installation
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_52267124636633
URL:https://calendar.ncsu.edu/event/sexual-assault-awareness-month-denim-in
 stallation-4693
END:VEVENT
