CREATED:20260325T194546Z
DESCRIPTION:<b>This event is intended for Queer and/or Trans survivors:</b
 ><br><br>💜Some of the biggest barriers to survivor safety are finance r
 elated. While we do our best to put cash directly into survivors hands\, i
 n tandem\, we thought it would be awesome to create a body doubling/cowork
 ing space where we can help each other executive function. 🤝 As well as
  offer relevant financial resources! That’s why we are launching “Get 
 Shit Done” evenings🤓<br><br>They will occur biweekly and alternate be
 tween virtual &amp\; in person. This first session on April 7th will be vi
 rtual via Zoom. Register here: <a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e
 /1FAIpQLSfArNdZts1tPf7AgktlXwBAyZvswSz221ltTE0Tu-1K5ONb3w/viewform">https:
 //docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSfArNdZts1tPf7AgktlXwBAyZvswSz221ltTE0T
 u-1K5ONb3w/viewform</a><br><br>If you or someone you know is a money exper
 t who wants to share their knowledge with <b>queer/trans survivors</b>\, p
 lease reach out!🍄‍🟫
LAST-MODIFIED:20260406T195137Z
LOCATION:in person - please register!
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-SOURCE:LGBTQ Center of Durham
END:VEVENT
