BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-ID:gcal_newhopeaudubon
SUMMARY:New Hope Birdathon
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260423
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260427
DTSTAMP:20260407T031314Z
UID:4qg38ul2nenq4kv3v3si4e0i0j@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;VALUE=DATE:20260423
SEQUENCE:0
CREATED:20260306T185814Z
DESCRIPTION:New Hope Bird Alliance is excited to welcome our community to 
 participate in our New Hope Birdathon! Grab your binoculars\, gather your 
 friends\, and get ready to bird this April 23-26 to see how many species y
 ou can find while raising funds for New Hope Bird Alliance. Our goal is to
  raise $15\,000 to help expand our organization's capacity and hire our fi
 rst paid staff\, an Executive Director. This will enable us to amplify our
  educational and conservation efforts\, bringing our passion for birds to 
 a broader audience in the Triangle. The situation for birds and wildlife i
 s deteriorating at an unsustainable pace\, but together\, we can make a di
 fference. Your support will help us achieve our goals and ensure a brighte
 r future for our feathered friends.<br><br>Birds need our help. Birds need
  new hope. Join the New Hope Birdathon and make your birding count. Learn 
 more and register <a target="_blank" href="https://charity.pledgeit.org/n
 ewhopebirdathon"><u>here</u></a>.
LAST-MODIFIED:20260306T185814Z
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
X-SOURCE:New Hope Bird Alliance
END:VEVENT
