BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Calendar 1 Ics": "https://calendar.ncsu.edu/event/live-at-lake-raleigh-kaira-ba-with-jennifer-curtis"}
X-SOURCE-ID:calendar_1_ics
X-SOURCE:NC State University
CATEGORIES:Performances
DESCRIPTION:Kaira Ba ecstatically explores the spiritual songs\, stories an
 d rhythms of Senegal’s millennia-old Mandé culture. Headed by Diali Cissokh
 o\, who comes from a long line of prominent griots\, the band integrates th
 e traditional sounds of the kora with guitars\, keyboard and an exuberant r
 hythm section. Kaira Ba will be joined by violinist Jennifer Curtis\, descr
 ibed as a “multi-genre maverick” by the San Diego Union-Tribune.\n\nThis fr
 ee\, family-friendly concert series on the picturesque shore of Lake Raleig
 h is a collaboration between NC State LIVE and NC State Centennial and cele
 brates the unique voices of North Carolina’s extraordinary music scene. Bri
 ng your picnic blankets and enjoy dance-inducing music\, delicious food and
  an amazing community gathering.\n\nThe gates will open and food trucks wil
 l be on-site at 5 p.m. Concerts will begin at 6 p.m.
DTEND:20260423T234500Z
DTSTAMP:20260407T030231Z
DTSTART:20260423T210000Z
GEO:35.767879;-78.677586
LOCATION:Lake Raleigh
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:LIVE at Lake Raleigh: Kaira Ba With Jennifer Curtis
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_52456806462328
URL:https://calendar.ncsu.edu/event/live-at-lake-raleigh-kaira-ba-with-jenn
 ifer-curtis
