 zman\, who is earning a Master of Arts in English with a concentration in f
 ilm studies\, will introduce the film and lead a talk-back session after th
 e film.\n\nWolfpack Pictures is a film collective run by graduate students 
 in the Department of English and the Ph.D. Program in Communication\, Rheto
 ric and Digital Media. If you have questions about the screening\, contect 
 faculty sponsor John Stadler.
