BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Calendar 1 Ics": "https://calendar.ncsu.edu/event/insider-talk-how-to-work-in-experience-design"}
X-SOURCE-ID:calendar_1_ics
X-SOURCE:NC State University
CATEGORIES:Lectures and Talks
DESCRIPTION:Ever wondered what it's like having a career designing exhibiti
 ons\, museums\, and cultural experiences? Join us with Gretchen Coss to lea
 rn how experience design teams bring stories to life across museums\, cultu
 ral institutions\, and public spaces. What you’ll learn:✅ What a career in 
 experience design can look like✅ The skills and projects that help juniors 
 stand out✅ Concrete steps you can take now to start building relevant exper
 ience About the Speaker: Gretchen is a visionary leader\, educator\, and de
 signer with over thirty-five years of experience in brand management\, expe
 rience design\, and placemaking. She is currently the Vice President of Str
 ategic Partnerships at G&A Design\, a design firm specializing in experient
 ial design that is based in New York. This event is brought to you by ArtBo
 und Initiative. ArtBound Initiative connects students and recent graduates 
 with key players in the creative industry in New York\, Chicago\, Los Angel
 es\, Miami\, Austin\, Berlin\, Melbourne\, Sydney & Virtual. The program in
 cludes: guaranteed internship\, internship coaching curriculum\, travel sup
 port (housing\, visa & insurance)\, and events.
DTEND:20260424T010000Z
DTSTAMP:20260407T030231Z
DTSTART:20260424T000000Z
LOCATION:
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Insider Talk: How to Work in Experience Design
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_52383263127457
URL:https://calendar.ncsu.edu/event/insider-talk-how-to-work-in-experience-
 design
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Calendar 1 Ics": "https://calendar.ncsu.edu/event/last-week-of-spring-semester-6099"}
X-SOURCE-ID:calendar_1_ics
X-SOURCE:NC State University
CATEGORIES:Academic Calendar
DESCRIPTION:Lab tests\, semester project reports and presentations are perm
 issible during the final week of classes. Papers and homework may have a du
 e date during the final week of classes only if scheduled in the syllabus. 
 However\, in order for students to prepare for final examinations\, faculty
  members may not assign other tests\, quizzes or additional papers during t
 he final week of classes. Assignments should not have a due date during the
  final exam period unless the assignment constitutes a part of the final ex
 am. Exceptions to this policy must be approved in advance by the department
  head and the dean of the college involved. Students should contact the app
 ropriate instructor or department head if they believe an assignment is not
  in compliance with this regulation.
DTSTAMP:20260407T030231Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260424
LOCATION:
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Last Week of Spring Semester
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_51450366949404
URL:https://calendar.ncsu.edu/event/last-week-of-spring-semester-6099
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Calendar 1 Ics": "https://calendar.ncsu.edu/event/sexual-assault-awareness-month-denim-installation-4693"}
X-SOURCE-ID:calendar_1_ics
X-SOURCE:NC State University
CATEGORIES:Community Events,Films
DESCRIPTION:Throughout April\, the Women’s Center will have a Denim Day–the
 med installation in the Talley Student Union lobby gallery as part of Sexua
 l Assault Awareness Month. This installation uses denim as a visual symbol 
 of solidarity with survivors and challenges harmful myths and victim-blamin
 g narratives. Visitors can engage with the display as an educational and re
 flective experience\, learning about the history of Denim Day\, the impact 
 of sexual violence and ways to support survivors on campus. The installatio
 n will offer a consistent awareness-raising presence in one of the universi
 ty’s most visible community spaces.
DTSTAMP:20260407T030231Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260424
GEO:35.784114;-78.671321
LOCATION:Talley Student Union
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Sexual Assault Awareness Month Denim Installation
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_52267124639708
URL:https://calendar.ncsu.edu/event/sexual-assault-awareness-month-denim-in
 stallation-4693
END:VEVENT
