 , Vitamins\, Body Care\, Cosmeceuticals\, Bulk Herbs\, CBD and a Red Light
  Therapy Room. There is nothing artificial as they focus on Organic\, Non 
 GMO and Regenerative Farmed sourced products. A message from the owners: H
 ealth Wisdom Naturals was founded in January 2026 by former Harmony Farms 
 Natural Foods Co-Owner Steve Long. We are conveniently located just off th
 e intersection of Capital Blvd and Main Street Wake Forest in Wake Pointe 
 Plaza to the left of the Walmart. We are extremely happy to be able to be 
 here to serve our community in helping you achieve an optimal thriving lif
 e through the natural ways!
