X-SOURCE-URLS:{"NC State University": "https://calendar.ncsu.edu/event/art2wear-symbiosis"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Calendar 1 Ics": "https://calendar.ncsu.edu/event/art2wear-symbiosis"}
X-SOURCE-ID:calendar_1_ics
X-SOURCE:NC State University
CATEGORIES:Community Events
DESCRIPTION:Art2Wear continues its traditions in pushing fashion and form i
 n their 2026 exhibit: Symbiosis. Symbiosis works to integrate designers’ un
 derstanding of interactions\, push and pulls\, constraints and appendages. 
 Whether ancient interactions between humanity and nature or emerging engage
 ments with technologies\, this year explores polarities in interactions to 
 showcase the impact of forces and the world’s curation when things come tog
 ether.\n\nArt2Wear 2026 will take place in three showings at The Gregg Muse
 um of Art and Design on April 23rd and April 24th. \n\nThursday\, April 23\
 , 7:00 - 9:00 pm Friday\, April 24\, 4:00 - 6:00 pm Friday\, April 24\, 7:0
 0 - 9:00 pm
DTEND:20260424T220000Z
DTSTAMP:20260407T030231Z
DTSTART:20260424T200000Z
GEO:35.784762;-78.661636
LOCATION:Gregg Museum of Art & Design
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Art2Wear 2026: Symbiosis
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_52507837446583
URL:https://calendar.ncsu.edu/event/art2wear-symbiosis
END:VEVENT
