X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_yogainnaturenc
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Yoga In Nature NC
UID:event_314076418@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260407T031309Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260425T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260425T103000
SUMMARY:YOGA IN NATURE™: ALL LEVELS Lake Johnson
DESCRIPTION:Yoga In Nature™\, NC\n**EARTH DAY YOGA SLOW FLOW and celebra
 ting YOGA IN NATURE™ 7 years!!!**\nPLEASE ARRIVE EARLY TO GET PARKING AN
 D FOR 5-10 MINUTE WALK TO THE LOCATION. Along Lake Johnson\, Raleigh. in o
 pen meadow\, above the lake. This was such a delightful discovery!!! I wil
 l be sending out exact location\, as there isn't a pin on the map for this
  one for practice. If you haven't been to a class with me here\, please me
 ssage me.\n\nALL LEVELS YOGA\, INCLUDING NEW AND BEGINNERS. Come join our 
 community as we explore our yoga and nature. 60 minute beginner to interme
 diate yoga class (options for all levels taught) beginning with a slower v
 inyasa flow to yin practice\, ending in savasana.\n\nBring a mat\, towel o
 r liner for under your mat to protect it (if ground is damp or wet)\, suns
 creen\, insect repellant\, water\, block or anything you may need for your
  outdoor practice. There will be shade and sun options for your practice.\
 n\nYou may want to pack walking shoes\, a book\, snack\, journal to make i
 t a longer commune with nature.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/yogainnaturenc/events/314076418/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260401T185211Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260401T185211Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-ID:gcal_41d85e1478a55e3b4adbf2e4951c5be9f6e49241ac55a65427c71d252849bf1c
SUMMARY:Defend Democracy Saturdays: Downtown Durham
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260425T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260425T113000
DTSTAMP:20260407T031319Z
UID:7vihpmeg1k6esqp5s5vsvq9hfe_R20260110T150000@google.com__20260425
SEQUENCE:1
CREATED:20251010T141601Z
DESCRIPTION:<p>Please join Engaged Defenders for Democracy every Saturday 
 from 10am-11:30am with signs to protect our democracy and protest the viol
 ations to our Constitution. We will meet at the YMCA at 218 West Morgan St
 .</p><p>We need to fight for our democracy and stop and prevent future cut
 s that are hurting many. Bring friends! Bring signs that show your concern
  or are a call to action. Please avoid triggering images like swastikas.</
 p><p>See you every Saturday morning engaging drivers &amp\; pedestrians in
  Downtown Durham!</p><p>Please join our Substack:<span> </span><a href="h
 ttps://substack.com/profile/115484101-engaged-defenders-4-democracy">https
 ://substack.com/profile/115484101-engaged-defenders-4-democracy</a></p><p>
 For more ED4D Mobilize Events:<span> </span><a href="https://www.mobilize
 .us/engagedefendersfordemocracy/">https://www.mobilize.us/engagedefendersf
 ordemocracy/</a></p><p><a href="https://www.mobilize.us/engagedefendersfor
 democracy/event/842514/">https://www.mobilize.us/engagedefendersfordemocra
 cy/event/842514/</a> </p>
