BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Calendar 1 Ics": "https://calendar.ncsu.edu/event/ftd-emerging-designers-runway-show"}
X-SOURCE-ID:calendar_1_ics
X-SOURCE:NC State University
CATEGORIES:Community Events
DESCRIPTION:The Emerging Designers Runway Show marks the culmination of fou
 r years of fashion design education in the fashion and textile design progr
 am at NC State University. This year’s showcase highlights the transformati
 on of concept into craftsmanship\, as graduating designers explore form\, f
 unction and identity through collections developed during their capstone co
 urse. From refined ready-to-wear to bold avant-garde expressions\, the work
  reflects both individual vision and technical mastery shaped in the studio
 s and labs of the Wilson College of Textiles.\n\nThe Emerging Designers Run
 way Show will be at Talley Student Union. Doors will open at 6:30 p.m. The 
 Runway show is at 7 p.m.\n\nTickets available here.
DTEND:20260426T010000Z
DTSTAMP:20260407T030231Z
DTSTART:20260425T223000Z
GEO:35.783987;-78.670804
LOCATION:Talley Student Union\, Piedmont / Mountains Ballroom
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Emerging Designers Runway Show
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_51943244315177
URL:https://calendar.ncsu.edu/event/ftd-emerging-designers-runway-show
