DESCRIPTION:Join Jessica W and  Wake Audubon for a Bird Outing at Bass La
 ke on <b>Sunday\, APRIL 26\, 2026\,  8:15 </b><br>The park opens at 8 am
 . The address is <b>900 Bass Lake Road\, Holly Springs\, NC</b> (note that
  this is the main parking lot\, not the smaller lot on another road). Meet
  at the end of the parking lot near the building. This  2+ mile walk on u
 npaved trails begins at 8:15 and ends shortly after 10:30. <br>**This out
 ing is on soft trails. We might cover the east side of the lake and then w
 alk to the adjacent Sugg Farm\, which is also part of Bass Lake Park. Wear
  shoes that can take a bit of mud as the trail if it has rained recently.<
 br>Leader is Jessica Williams (<a href="mailto:jesswilliams888@gmail.com" 
 target="_blank">jesswilliams888@gmail.com</a>\, 913-424-5062).
