X-SOURCE-ID:gcal_enoriver_org_9u7o786v1jlk6heq5cp3k1gr1k
SUMMARY:ERA - Guided Wildflower Hike - Pump Station
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260426T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260426T160000
DTSTAMP:20260407T031316Z
UID:0j05llp5b873cg4fnk66d70716@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20260426T140000
SEQUENCE:0
CREATED:20260219T161741Z
DESCRIPTION:<p><u><u><a href="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/1983546352536?a
 ff=oddtdtcreator" target="_blank">Registration is required</a></u></u> - 
 Tickets drop on March 1st at 8:00am!<br>Price: $4<br>*Ticket prices direct
 ly support the work of the Eno River Association. Thank you for your suppo
 rt!</p><p><br></p><p>This is a hike on a well maintained trail. With luck 
 and the right flowering time\, you might see a Ladyslipper orchid! This is
  an easy hike with a few gentle hills and is known for the beauty of the w
 ildflowers that bloom each spring. Walking sticks are recommended as we wi
 ll step off trail.</p><p><br></p><p>This hike will take approximately two 
 hours (sometimes less\, sometimes more). Please feel free to bring water a
 nd snacks. Wear comfortable\, weather appropriate clothing and shoes. Well
 -behaved dogs are welcome as long as they are under your control and on a 
 6 foot leash.</p><p>Children under the age of 6 do not require a ticket.</
 p><p>This event is rain or shine. We will contact you if severe weather is
  expected that would cause us to cancel the hike.</p><p>There is no need t
 o print your ticket - we have you on the list now!</p><p>If your plans cha
 nge and you are unable to attend the hike\, please contact hillary@enorive
 r.org to cancel your registration so that we may offer your spot(s) to our
  waitlist.</p><p><br></p><p>Directions: IMPORTANT - There are two Pump Sta
 tion trailheads along Rivermont Road. We will meet at the second trailhead
  on Rivermont when coming from Cole Mill Road. Park along the road at the 
 bridge over Nancy Rhodes Creek\, on Rivermont Drive. We will meet next to 
 the bridge. Rivermont runs between Cole Mill and Valley Springs. The addre
 ss is 4023 Rivermont Road\, Durham\, NC 27712.</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260219T161741Z
LOCATION:4023 Rivermont Rd\, Durham\, NC 27712\, USA
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
X-SOURCE:Eno River Association
END:VEVENT
