DESCRIPTION:The Department of English invites you to its annual First-Year 
 Writing Showcase. The showcase will highlight exemplary interdisciplinary w
 riting projects produced in English 101. These projects span a wide range o
 f topics and engage multiple genres and modes of writing\, celebrating the 
 curiosity\, creativity and intellectual risk-taking of our first-year write
 rs at NC State. This event is open to the public. Light refreshments will b
 e served.\n\nStudents will present their work between 10 a.m. and noon. The
 ir work will remain on display at D.H. Hill Jr. Library in the iPearl Innov
 ation Studio and the Cyma Rubin Visualization Gallery until 4 p.m.
