DESCRIPTION:The NC State University Police Department\, Wellness and Recrea
 tion and Prevention Services are teaming to offer students a fun\, relaxing
  opportunity to de-stress and enjoy time with the police department's furry
  friends.\n\nCome take a break from exam week and attend a birthday party f
 or the police department's K-9s. Come celebrate with us at Stafford Commons
  on May 1 from noon to 1 p.m.\n\nIf there is inclement weather May 1\, the 
 party will be inside Talley Student Union on the second floor.
DTEND:20260501T170000Z
