BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Durhamcentralpark": "https://durhamcentralpark.org/upcoming-event/playlist-concert-series-2/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:durhamcentralpark
X-SOURCE:Durham Central Park
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260501T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260501T220000
DTSTAMP:20260406T230931
CREATED:20260324T201008Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260403T203344Z
UID:13404-1777660200-1777672800@durhamcentralpark.org
SUMMARY:PLAYlist Presents: Kaleta y Super Yamba
DESCRIPTION:Durham Central Park and WNCU 90.7FM Present: PLAYlist Concert Series\nMusic Magic and Community in the Heart of Downtown Durham\nPLAYlist Presents Kaleta & Super Yamba Band May 1st\nAfrofunk LEGEND\, Kaleta & Super Yamba Band are fronted by Afrobeat and Juju veteran Leon Ligan-Majek a.k.a. Kaleta. Now based in New York City\, Kaleta has been leading Super Yamba Band since 2017. Kaleta y Super Yamba are taking the stage at PLAYlist’s Opening Night. \n  \nABOUT PLAYlist Concert Series\nPLAYlist is a free concert series presented by Durham Central Park and WNCU 90.7FM. The concerts take place on the first Friday of the month from May to October at Durham Central Park\,  501 Foster Street in Downtown Durham\, North Carolina. Concerts take place rain or shine. \nEach evening starts with dinner and drinks open for service at 6:30pm\, and DJ Travis Gales spinning his Friday Night Mix live at the park at 7 p.m. Then the band takes the stage at 7:30 p.m. sharp. All the music is simulcast live through WNCU 90.7 FM. Then\, after the show\, DJ Travis will close the night out with a Dance Party in the Park! \nThere are restrooms at Durham Central Park and the venue is wheelchair accessible. Parking is free in the lots caddy-cornered and above the park (entrances are on Foster St. and Morris St). \nLocal food trucks will be on site\, as well as craft beer and other vendors at the Night Market. \nThere’s lawn seating\, so please bring a blanket or lawn chair. Leashed pets are welcome. \n**PLAYlist Concert Series features ASL interpreters for deaf and hard-of-hearing attendees** \n 
URL:https://durhamcentralpark.org/upcoming-event/playlist-concert-series-2/
LOCATION:Durham Central Park\, 501 Foster Street\, Durham\, NC\, 27701\, United States
CATEGORIES:Featured Events,PLAYlist Concert Series
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://durhamcentralpark.org/content/uploads/May-FB-timeline-v1a.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Durham Central Park":MAILTO:info@durhamcentralpark.org
END:VEVENT
