SUMMARY:Yoga In Nature™\, ALL LEVELS Vinyasa Flow\, NCMA
DESCRIPTION:Yoga In Nature™\, NC\n**ALL LEVELS WELCOME**. Join us for a 
 vinyasa flow to yin practice ending in savasana. Join our community and me
 et other like-minded people! Yoga heals. Nature heals. Yoga In Nature™.\
 n\nBEGINNERS WELCOME AND MODIFICATIONS PROVIDED.\n\nPractice vinyasa flow 
 to yin yoga at North Carolina Museum of Art\, outdoors near upper parking 
 area in grass ellipse... (NOTE THIS GRASS LOCATION\, as there are other gr
 oups that use NCMA grounds). WHEN YOU COME INTO THE PARKING LOT\, DRIVE TO
  WHERE THE TWO PARKING LOTS ON BLUE RIDGE MEET\, AWAY FROM THE MUSEUM. We 
 practice in the grass Ellipse area:)\n$15/person\nCash\nVenmo @Darlene-Gen
 ander (0862)\nPaypal dgenander@yogainnature.com\nZelle\n\nCome flow with u
 s. Meet others and make friends in our yoga community.\nBring a mat or tow
 el for the ground\; water\; sunscreen\; and anything else you may need for
  your outdoor yoga practice. You may also want a plastic liner for under y
 our mat\, if the grass is damp.\nALL LEVELS WELCOME.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/yogainnaturenc/events/314076517/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
