BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-ID:gcal_41d85e1478a55e3b4adbf2e4951c5be9f6e49241ac55a65427c71d252849bf1c
SUMMARY:Cultivating Courage by Covering the Corners
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260503T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260503T143000
DTSTAMP:20260407T031319Z
UID:3flgdopipaqihus5e750oud5cs@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20260503T130000
SEQUENCE:0
CREATED:20260123T172950Z
DESCRIPTION:Join us on the first Sunday of the month as we do a coordinate
 d demonstration on multiple corners (Feb 1 is just for colleges and has it
 s own link). All events are from 1pm-2:30pm as we host “Cultivating Cour
 age by Covering Corners\,” a peaceful visibility event designed to build
  courage and unity in support of democracy. \n\nPlease sign up for your co
 rner on SignUp Genius:  \n\nSmall groups will gather on consecutive corner
 s along a key stretch of road\, holding positive\, pro-democracy signs. We
  will cover corners in areas where ED4D does typically do not demonstrate:
  Creedmoor\, Holly Springs\, and XXX. All of these areas are purple. \n\nT
 he purpose is to build motivation for folks to join us. By standing togeth
 er on multiple corners simultaneously\, we show our community that courage
  is contagious—that even small acts of presence can inspire others to st
 and up for shared values.\n\nEach participant plays an essential role: bei
 ng visible\, being brave\, and encouraging others to do the same. The goal
  is to create a ripple of courage that spreads across our community and be
 yond.\n\nWe will have one common sign at each corner. People will need to 
 bring their own signs. Please also consider bring an American flag along w
 ith one of several other flags (rainbow flag\, Palestine flag\, Mexican fl
 ag\, Ukraine flag)\, to make it clear we are not MAGA. We have rainbow fla
 gs for each corner. \n\nPlease make signs that say\, “Stand up\, you are
  not alone!” “Resist!” “Courage is contagious!” &quot\;Call your
  elected officials&quot\; &quot\;Vote&quot\; &quot\;We the People Have Pow
 er!&quot\; &quot\;Start your own demonstration!!&quot\;\n\nPlease join ED4
 D&#39\;s Substack: <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://substack.
 com/profile/115484101-engaged-durhamites-4-democracy&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source
 =calendar&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw3MkrdMQVANb4wodoztKfro" target="_blank
 ">https://substack.com/profile/115484101-engaged-durhamites-4-democracy</a
 >\n\nFor more ED4D Mobilize Events: <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=
 https://www.mobilize.us/engageddurhamitesfordemocracy/&amp\;sa=D&amp\;sour
 ce=calendar&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw1HNjXvhsaaRZW9d-Z5Bxjt" target="_bla
 nk">https://www.mobilize.us/engageddurhamitesfordemocracy/</a>\n\n<a href=
 "https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.mobilize.us/engagedefendersforde
 mocracy/event/867070/&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=A
 OvVaw0WpHPJqn2tXvfeX1374LWb" target="_blank">https://www.mobilize.us/engag
 edefendersfordemocracy/event/867070/</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260123T172950Z
LOCATION:Corners all over the Triangle and beyond!\, Durham\, NC\, 27705
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-SOURCE:Durham Resistance (In Person)
END:VEVENT
