DESCRIPTION:Transforming Families NC<br><p>Meet fellow parents and caregiv
 ers raising transgender\, non-binary and gender diverse youth in a safe\
 , affirming space. We'll share knowledge\, experiences\, &amp\; concerns.
  Confidentiality is very important\, as we are all at different stages of
  our journey.</p><p>Join us on the 1st and 3rd Sunday of the month from 4
 :30pm to 6pm for an open and honest discussion group for parents of gender
  creative children (child’s age does not matter). </p><p>Contact Alix o
 r Nan for more information at: <a href="mailto:transformingfamiliesnc@lgb
 tqcenterofdurham.org" target="_blank">transformingfamiliesnc@<u></u>lgbtqc
 enterofdurham.org</a></p>
