BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Calendar 1 Ics": "https://calendar.ncsu.edu/event/what-we-leave-behind"}
X-SOURCE-ID:calendar_1_ics
X-SOURCE:NC State University
CATEGORIES:Community Events,Exhibitions
DESCRIPTION:"What We Leave Behind" is a photography exhibition created by N
 orth Carolina State University graduate student\, communication scholar and
  photographer\, Oluwasola Israel Abimbola. This exhibition explores the vis
 ual and environmental legacy of plastics in contemporary life through a ser
 ies of portraits and constructed scenes\, juxtaposing plastic and nature wi
 thin and around the human body in paradoxical ways.\n\nA passionate environ
 mental sustainability scholar\, Abimbola draws from scholarship in visual r
 hetoric and environmental sustainability to develop photographic images tha
 t lead viewers to reflect on their relationship with everyday materials and
  the environmental consequences of thoughtless modern consumption. It prese
 nts plastic not only as waste\, but as a lasting imprint of human behavior\
 , an enduring record of what we consume\, how we live\, and what we leave b
 ehind for future generations.\n\nABOUT THE ARTIST\nOluwasola Israel Abimbol
 a is a Nigerian photographer\, visual storyteller\, and communication schol
 ar based in Raleigh\, North Carolina. He is a master's degree student in Co
 mmunication at North Carolina State University\, where his work bridges vis
 ual rhetoric\, environmental communication\, and sustainable fashion. Acros
 s both his academic research and creative practice\, he is interested in ho
 w images shape public meaning\, memory\, and understanding in an increasing
 ly image-saturated world. Abimbola’s work is a reflection of his encounters
  with the dangers of environmental waste\, which shaped his awareness of su
 stainability.\n\nThese experiences continue to inform his artistic language
 \, which blends minimalism with symbolic intensity. He creates images that 
 are both aesthetically striking and conceptually layered.\n\nAbimbola merge
 s scholarship with artistic practice\, thereby presenting photography as a 
 catalyst for environmental awareness\, cultural memory\, and imaginative po
 ssibility.
DTEND:20260505T210000Z
DTSTAMP:20260407T030232Z
DTSTART:20260505T160000Z
GEO:35.787474;-78.669399
LOCATION:Cyma Rubbin Visualization Gallery\,  3208A
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:What We Leave Behind
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_52489626718079
URL:https://calendar.ncsu.edu/event/what-we-leave-behind
END:VEVENT
