DESCRIPTION:Link to join: https://www.mobilize.us/join/48337817/1:f884e0dd
 d91de47138cd36ffa1d4b277918b467ca81af51c01d18ee57f5b30cd/\n\nHow to join:\
 nJoin Zoom Meeting\n\n\nhttps://blackvotersmatterfund-org.zoom.us/j/896006
 70661?pwd=B90IL6Wy13HenaML00S2RCMajanZ5M.1\n\n\n\n\n\nMeeting ID: 896 0067
  0661\n\n\nPasscode: 342549\n\n\n\n\n\n---\n\n\n\n\n\nOne tap mobile\n\n\n
 +19294362866\,\,89600670661#\,\,\,\,*342549# US (New York)\n\n\n+130171585
 92\,\,89600670661#\,\,\,\,*342549# US (Washington DC)\n\n\n\n\n\nJoin inst
 ructions\n\n\nhttps://blackvotersmatterfund-org.zoom.us/meetings/896006706
 61/invitations?signature=izTjgjtFsOca31LQZXAI2FZyR681QgAYXEvxukqs_P8\n\nJo
 in Black Voters Matter for our Warrant Clinic phonebank.\n\nWhat is a warr
 ant clinic? A warrant clinic is a ONE-DAY community-led grassroots program
  designed to help people eliminate their warrants due to misdemeanor offen
 ses and traffic violations. It is an entry point to activism and civic eng
 agement.\n\nWhat will you do as a volunteer?: Help us reach out to residen
 ts and provide them with next steps for their warrant(s).\n\nWe provide tr
 aining via Zoom. Which means\, no matter what state you live in\, you can 
 volunteer!\n\nHow to prepare:\nFill out the volunteer agreement here - htt
 ps://forms.office.com/r/TiaHyteJg9\n\nLearn more about the warrant clinic 
 by:\n1. Creating a Moodle account here -  https://learn.blackvotersmatterf
 und.org/ \n2. Once you account is approved\, look for the warrant clinic t
 raining course.\n3. Complete the training course and join us at the next p
 honebank.\n\nhttps://www.mobilize.us/blackvotersmatter/event/888301/
LAST-MODIFIED:20260204T152449Z
