X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Events 1 Ics": "https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/whats-so-cool-about-eagles-anyway"}
X-SOURCE-ID:events_1_ics
X-SOURCE:NC Cultural Resources
CATEGORIES:Education Programs,Youth & Family Activities
DESCRIPTION:Our nation's bird could have been the turkey but Benjamin Frank
 lin didn' tget his way and it became the eagle! But what's the big deal abo
 ut these birds? Come learn with a Ranger all about eagles and play a fun ea
 gle game.
