DESCRIPTION:<p><strong>Wake Audubon Monthly Meeting:</strong> </p><p><b><
 i>(Meeting is usually In Person and Zoom\, but check back for updates!)</i
 ></b></p><p>Time: <strong>Second Tuesday of the month</strong>\, 7:30 - 9:
 00 pm<br>Nature Research Center\, 121 W. Jones St\, Raleigh\, NC 27601</p>
 <p><br>Place: In-person + Virtual via Zoom <br>Location: NC Museum of Nat
 ural Sciences: Nature Research Center\, 121 W Jones St\, Raleigh\, NC - 4t
 h floor meeting room</p><p>Location: In-person + Zoom (Note:<i> The two s
 peakers will be on Zoom</i> )<br>Place: In-person + Virtual - use <a hre
 f="https://www.zoom.us/join" target="_blank"><u>https://www.zoom.us/join</
 u></a>  \, choose "Join meeting" (no login needed)</p><ul><li>Meeting cod
 e: <strong>831 3786 5298</strong></li><li>Password: <strong>4Birds</stro
 ng></li></ul><p>Park (for free after 6:30 pm) and walk to the main museum 
 entrance on Jones Street\, <strong>just to the right of the giant globe.<
 /strong> <b><i>Since the NC Museum of Natural Sciences is usually closed 
 at night\, someone will be at the door ONLY from 7 to 7:45 to let you in\,
  so please be on time.</i></b> Take the elevator to the fourth floor meeti
 ng room. The east-facing entrance of the "old wing" of the museum will not
  be used. If you feel unwell\, please stay home and enjoy our presentation
  over Zoom</p><p>We hope you will help us by joining Wake Audubon and Nati
 onal Audubon!<br>visit <a href="http://wakeaudubon.org" target="_blank">wa
 keaudubon.org</a></p><p>*Last updated 2025-07-17 by Beegle<br>WATCH for up
 dates. Location and date sometime change!</p>
