 g lot of Roses lot on Hwy 54. Go behind Southpoint Mall to the AMC theater
  parking lot. Walk towards Hwy 40 and look for entrance to the trail. It i
 s a 4-minute walk. You also can park at Rose's\, 105 W NC. Hwy 54 27713. T
 he walk to the bridge from Roses is a 4-minute walk.<br><br>We will have a
  big sign. If you bring signs\, please make sure they are positive and sho
 w what we are fighting for: "Freedom 4 All" "Protect Free Speech." Please 
 bring American flags to wave as well.<br><br>See you every Thursday mornin
 g engaging drivers &amp\; pedestrians  in Durham! <br><br>Please join our 
