DESCRIPTION:Wake Audubon Book Club<br><b>Tuesday\, May 19\, 2026\, 6:45 pm
  to 8:00pm</b><br>MacGregor Village STARBUCKS\, 101 S Edinburgh Drive\, Ca
 ry\, NC.<br><br> We will be discussing <b>The Light Eaters </b> by  ZO
 Ë SCHLANGER<br>This New York Times Bestseller is part detective story\, 
 field trip\, and philosophy. <br><br>This brilliant book stretches the mi
 nd toward a profound new understanding of the sophistication of under-appr
 eciated plants.<br><br>Our next meeting will be at Starbucks. Please bring
  a readily-available book to suggest for our next Book Club meeting. You a
 re also encouraged to participate in our book exchange (bring books to giv
 e away or trade). Thanks<br><br><i>Please be prepared to make a small purc
 hase to justify our free use of the conference room.</i>
