DESCRIPTION:Step back in time and celebrate America’s 250th with the Histor
 ical Society on this immersive\, one-day journey to Charlotte! We’ll begin 
 at Historic Rosedale\, Charlotte’s second-oldest home\, and its picturesque
  gardens. Then\, travel to the Charlotte Museum of History\, where you can 
 dive into the past with the American Revolution Immersive Experience. Ticke
 ts will be $81\, lunch is not provided. Contact the Museum to RSVP: 336.883
 .3021 or crystal.williams@highpointnc.gov.
