BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Calendar 1 Ics": "https://calendar.ncsu.edu/event/live-at-lake-raleigh-palmyra"}
X-SOURCE-ID:calendar_1_ics
X-SOURCE:NC State University
CATEGORIES:Performances
DESCRIPTION:For the final concert of the 2026 LIVE at Lake Raleigh series\,
  we welcome the Virginia-based Americana/folk rock band Palmyra. This trio 
 — first seen by our team at Raleigh Wide Open last October — exists at the 
 intersection of indie rock and raw folk music. They explore the fusion of t
 raditional folk string instruments\, lush harmony\, and earnest songwriting
 .\n\nThis free\, family-friendly concert series on the picturesque shore of
  Lake Raleigh is a collaboration between NC State LIVE and NC State Centenn
 ial and celebrates the unique voices of North Carolina’s extraordinary musi
 c scene. Bring your picnic blankets and enjoy dance-inducing music\, delici
 ous food and an amazing community gathering.\n\nThe gates will open and foo
 d trucks will be on-site at 5 p.m. Concerts will begin at 6 p.m.
DTEND:20260521T234500Z
DTSTAMP:20260407T030232Z
DTSTART:20260521T210000Z
GEO:35.767879;-78.677586
LOCATION:Lake Raleigh
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:LIVE at Lake Raleigh: Palmyra
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_52456886154167
URL:https://calendar.ncsu.edu/event/live-at-lake-raleigh-palmyra
END:VEVENT
