X-SOURCE:NC Cultural Resources
CATEGORIES:Outdoor & Recreation,Nature & Wildlife Programs
DESCRIPTION:Join a ranger for a half mile walk along the marsh section of t
 he Elliot Cause nature trail. We will learn and talk about Dr. Cause’s life
  and how he studied nature while stationed at Ft. Macon from 1869-1870.  Pa
 rticipants should meet at the bathhouse / beach access area trail head. Bri
 ng water\, bug spray and wear sturdy shoes.  Pets are allowed but must be o
 n a leash.
