CATEGORIES:Workshops and Training
DESCRIPTION:In a two-part workshop\, the Graduate School will provide strat
 egies for planning and managing a writing project and fundamental tips for 
 structuring writing for a variety of contexts. Participants will clarify th
 eir writing goals for the semester and learn strategies to implement on cur
 rent and future writing projects. We will use different genres of writing a
 s case studies\, so participants can learn tips for summarizing\, paraphras
 ing and synthesizing their writing projects.
