 he group will start and finish at Crank Arm. Hang out and enjoy a beer aft
 er.</p><p>Don't forget your helmet.</p><p>Lets have fun and be safe!<br><b
 r></p><p>more info: <a href="https://www.meetup.com/crank-arm-cycling-runn
 ing-yoga/events/303334626/?eventOrigin=group_calendar">https://www.meetup.
