DESCRIPTION:Please join Engaged Defenders for Democracy on Mondays from 4:
 30-6pm at the corner of Franklin St &amp\; Elliott Rd in Chapel Hill for a
  weekly\, peaceful\, nonpartisan protest and call to action. Free parking 
 at the Church of Reconciliation\, 110 N Elliott Rd.\n\nAcross the politica
 l spectrum\, Americans are disillusioned by leaders who put power over peo
 ple. We gather to build community\, spark hope\, and inspire action.\n\nBr
 ing a friend. Bring a sign. Speak up for immigrant rights\, free speech\, 
 healthcare\, social security\, the environment\, the Constitution and the 
 rule of law\, reproductive freedom\, job and funding cuts\, and the many\,
  many other issues close to our hearts. Bonus points for signs that encour
 age others to move beyond honking and help turn awareness into action. \n
 We often hand out fliers to stopped cars &amp\; pedestrians with informati
 on about relevant actions folks can take to support their community and de
 fend democracy. We also have a Signal chat for regular attenders. If you a
 re interested in either of these opportunities\, ask around for Wendy.\n--
 -------\nTIME\nStarting Monday March 9th\, will switch to 4:30-6 pm - Nov 
 2. Then will switch back to 3:30-5 pm.\n\nThis will be a POSITIVE and nonv
 iolent demonstration. We are here to protect our democracy. We are standin
 g up for what we believe in. We want to inspire people to join us and grow
  our movement!\n\nPlease bring positive signs supporting the movement and 
 resisting what is happening in our country!\n\nPlease no mocking signs\, n
 o swastikas\n\nWe are excited to see you there and stand together for our 
 country!\n\nSee you every Monday afternoon engaging drivers in Chapel Hill
 !\n\nPlease join our Substack: <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https
 ://substack.com/profile/115484101-engaged-defenders-4-democracy&amp\;sa=D&
 amp\;source=calendar&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw3y7Kv9RwiMPWcPPUFQih9k" tar
 get="_blank">https://substack.com/profile/115484101-engaged-defenders-4-de
 mocracy</a>\n\nFor more ED4D Mobilize Events: <a href="https://www.google.
 com/url?q=https://www.mobilize.us/engagedefendersfordemocracy/&amp\;sa=D&a
 mp\;source=calendar&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw1xqNbFip0P6DfK4plFB1D7" targ
 et="_blank">https://www.mobilize.us/engagedefendersfordemocracy/</a>\n\n<a
