 enter reading Floyd Cooper’s Juneteenth for Mazie that we be posted on the 
 walls. We will also have a make your own Juneteenth Flag craft station set 
 up the 19th!\n\nJuneteenth for Mazie was written by Floyd Cooper published 
 by Picture Windows Books 2015. The StoryWalk® Project was created by Anne F
 erguson of Montpelier\, Vermont.
