BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Events 1 Ics": "https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/staying-alive"}
X-SOURCE-ID:events_1_ics
X-SOURCE:NC Cultural Resources
CATEGORIES:Exhibits & Tours,Exhibitions
DESCRIPTION:March 14 – August 23\, 2026\n\nIn the ultimate battle for survi
 val\, every animal has a plan.\n\nExplore the striking ways nature fights b
 ack in “Staying Alive\,” featuring 17 live animals from around the world wi
 th unbelievable self-defense strategies. Come face to face with trippy toad
 s\, armored armadillos\, a two-toed sloth and more.\n\nDiscover how these d
 efenders deploy an amazing arsenal of high-fashion camouflage and mimicry\,
  specialized armor and advanced chemical warfare – like stink bombs\, caboo
 se cannons and smoke screens – to hide in plain sight\, stand their ground 
 or even drop a limb and make a run for it. Enjoy live animal encounters\, l
 arger-than-life sculptures\, 3D tactile experiences and interactive program
 s.\n\nPerfect for families and animal enthusiasts of all ages. Offered in E
 nglish & Spanish.
DTEND:20260610T210000Z
DTSTAMP:20260407T030455Z
DTSTART:20260610T140000Z
GEO:35.782156;-78.639336
LOCATION:North Carolina Museum of Natural Sciences
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Staying Alive 
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_52207082981629
URL:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/staying-alive
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup Data Science Nc": "https://www.meetup.com/data-science-nc/events/313263417/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_data_science_nc
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Data Science Raleigh
UID:event_313263417@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260407T031312Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260610T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260610T160000
SUMMARY: Plug & Play: Live AI Workflows in Action Q2
DESCRIPTION:Data Science Raleigh\nForget static demos and slide decks. Plu
 g & Play Sessions are all about showing\, not telling. In this hands-on we
 binar series\, you'll see tech leaders walk through their AI product in re
 al time\, highlighting exactly how it works in the wild: setup\, workflows
 \, integrations\, all in just 30 minutes.\n\nBuilt on the momentum of our 
 AI Demo Day format\, Plug & Play goes deeper. Presenters slow down and dig
  in: demonstrating usability\, showing off speed to value\, and guiding at
 tendees through common real-world scenarios. It’s a rare opportunity to 
 see how tools behave under actual conditions\, not just polished slides.\n
 \nExpect 2–3 hours of back-to-back\, engaging walkthroughs. Attendees ar
 e encouraged to click along live\, ask questions\, and walk away with more
  than awareness—usable knowledge.\n\n**Key Takeaways:**\n\n1️⃣ **Rea
 l Product Experience:** See full workflows in motion—not just the highli
 ghts.\n\n2️⃣ **Usability in Focus:** Evaluate ease of use\, integratio
 n paths\, and how quickly value is delivered.\n\n3️⃣ **Interactive Lea
 rning:** Follow along live and get answers as you go.\n\n4️⃣ **Depth O
 ver Demos:** A deeper understanding of how AI tools actually fit into your
  stack.\n\n**[Register here](https://hubs.ly/Q042d02S0)**
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/data-science-nc/events/313263417/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260208T124422Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260208T124422Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
