DESCRIPTION:Link to join: https://www.mobilize.us/join/48393600/1:6c11b6de
 f19d8c1112f31b2d9013f8cf2c5f7ed366388daad27b2ab072ec5991/\n\n### Join Our 
 Greater Triangle Regional Coalition Meeting\n\n- 📅 **When**: 3rd Wednes
 day of every month\, 6:00 – 7:00 PM\n- 📍 **Where**: Virtual (Online)\
 n\nDemocracy NC’s Greater Triangle region covers **Wake\, Harnett\, and 
 Johnston counties.**\n\n**We come together to:**\n\n- Build strong grassro
 ots leadership\n- Equip people to take action\n- Serve “the good of the 
 whole”\n\nWhether you’re brand new or already engaged\, this space is 
 for learning\, sharing\, and organizing for **a movement built of\, by\, a
 nd for the people**\, grounded in equity\, solidarity\, and justice.\n\n**
 A note from your Greater Triangle Regional Managing Organizer:** \nI’m p
 assionate about building community\, amplifying voices\, and creating spac
 es where people can be heard and find their role in supporting civic engag
 ement and protecting our democracy. This work keeps me grounded\, and I’
 m excited to invite you to be part of it.\n\n**Join us\, share your voice\
 , and help shape the work ahead!**\n\nHow to prepare:\nThank you for signi
 ng up to attend our monthly coalition meeting!\n\nEach month\, you’ll ge
 t a reminder with details on what we’ll be discussing and the actions we
  can take together. We’re excited to stay connected and work alongside y
 ou to make an impact.\n\nHope to see you online!\n\n— Sugelema Lynch\n\n
 https://www.mobilize.us/democracync/event/896413/
LAST-MODIFIED:20260206T014450Z
