BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-ID:gcal_41d85e1478a55e3b4adbf2e4951c5be9f6e49241ac55a65427c71d252849bf1c
SUMMARY:ICE Is Not Welcome Here! Cary ICE Detention Center
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260619T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260619T110000
DTSTAMP:20260407T031319Z
UID:ong6reckd2k3ag9dj2572ku0om@google.com__20260619
SEQUENCE:1
CREATED:20260212T203737Z
DESCRIPTION:Please join Engaged Defenders for Democracy as will gather to 
 demonstrate at the ICE facility in Cary. We will stand along Evans Road at
  the corner of Evans and Centrewest Court\, near the Cary ICE office (140 
 Centrewest Ct\, Cary). \n\nParking is available along Centrewest Court\, o
 r along Quade Drive (off Evans Road). This action serves to let ICE know w
 e do not welcome them here and also make community residents aware that IC
 E has an office - and an ongoing presence - right here in Cary.\n\nThis wi
 ll be a nonviolent demonstration. We are here to say ICE is not welcome. W
 e are standing up for what we believe in. We want to inspire people to joi
 n us and grow our movement!\n\nPlease bring signs\; no swastikas please.\n
 \nWe are excited to see you there and stand together for our country and l
 et ICE know they are not welcome!\n\nSee you every Friday morning engaging
  drivers in Cary.\n\nPlease join our Substack: <a href="https://www.google
 .com/url?q=https://substack.com/profile/115484101-engaged-defenders-4-demo
 cracy&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw3y7Kv9RwiMP
 WcPPUFQih9k" target="_blank">https://substack.com/profile/115484101-engage
 d-defenders-4-democracy</a>\n\nFor more ED4D Mobilize Events: <a href="htt
 ps://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.mobilize.us/engagedefendersfordemocr
 acy/&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw1xqNbFip0P6D
 fK4plFB1D7" target="_blank">https://www.mobilize.us/engagedefendersfordemo
 cracy/</a>\n\n<a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.mobilize.u
 s/engagedefendersfordemocracy/event/896777/&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar
 &amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw3T8EtOQ8r0gLPlo0-wcFO3" target="_blank">https:/
 /www.mobilize.us/engagedefendersfordemocracy/event/896777/</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260306T223234Z
LOCATION:ICE headquarters\, 140 Centrewest Ct\, Cary\, NC\, 27513
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-SOURCE:Durham Resistance (In Person)
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-ID:gcal_f511c08827b961733168ea93761e472cd12de35e813c3a73af3e44c56b7fe53d
SUMMARY:UU Justice NC’s Friday Action Hour
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260619T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260619T120000
DTSTAMP:20260407T031320Z
UID:1tvd180uho6fnokuhaj2c5h1k8_R20251107T160000@google.com__20260619
SEQUENCE:0
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20250729T151905Z
DESCRIPTION:11:00am-12:00pm: Unitarian Universalist Justice NC’s Friday 
 Action Hour. <a href="https://us06web.zoom.us/w/87452791684?_x_zm_rtaid=7M
 gmJB_hSsCKh3xUYHZrBA.1750590489156.1865f9b53934845e34cb2d06c2d1adc5&_x_zm_
 rhtaid=5#success" target="_blank"><u>Zoom here </u></a><br><u> </u><br><
 p>Since May of 2020\, North Carolina UUs and friends have gathered on Frid
 ays to take action and experience the joy and power of community. Every Fr
 iday at 11:00am we recap the past week and take action on the issues impac
 ting our state and country. And there is always great music to help us fee
 l the justice movement in our bones! ALL are welcome! We are also blessed 
 to be joined by Unitarian Universalists\, our beloved North Carolina justi
 ce partners\, and dear friends from outside our state (shout out to our We
 st Virginia fam!).</p><p>You can join us <strong>every Friday </strong>at 
 11:00 am via this <a href="https://us06web.zoom.us/meeting/register/tZMpcu
 uvpzosEtAhdqFHrSySSb6REM8wkPru">Zoom link</a>. And if you can't make it on
  Fridays\, you can still take action at any time - just check out our <a h
 ref="https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Fwj6m0Qw4fAH_keuIoUNgdSWslBZzVgQ5
 NCgVPm_L-U/edit?tab=t.0" class="pastedDriveLink-0">Weekly action list</a>.
  And sign up for our <a href="https://secure.everyaction.com/QSBiJQ1YQEGwP
 O2KMIRIkQ2" target="_blank">Weekly Friday Action Hour Email</a> that inclu
 des a promo of the week's actions\, Zoom link\, and link to our Actions Go
 ogle Doc.</p><p><a href="https://www.uujusticenc.org/get-involved/friday-a
 ction-hour/">https://www.uujusticenc.org/get-involved/friday-action-hour/<
 /a> </p><u> </u>
LAST-MODIFIED:20251031T142802Z
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-SOURCE:Durham Resistance (Virtual NC)
END:VEVENT
