DESCRIPTION:Transforming Families NC<br><p>Meet fellow parents and caregiv
 ers raising transgender\, non-binary and gender diverse youth in a safe\
 , affirming space. We&#39\;ll share knowledge\, experiences &amp\; concer
 ns. Confidentiality is very important\, as we are all at different stages 
 of our journey.</p><p>Join us on the 1st and 3rd Sunday of the month from
  4:30pm to 6pm for an open and honest discussion group for parents of gend
 er creative children (child’s age does not matter). </p><p>Contact Alix
  or Nan for more information at: <a href="mailto:transformingfamiliesnc@l
 gbtqcenterofdurham.org" target="_blank">transformingfamiliesnc@<u></u>lgbt
 qcenterofdurham.org</a></p>
