DESCRIPTION:The Avery County Heritage Festival commemorates the history and
  heritage of our county including the genealogies of our Avery County famil
 ies. Traditional craftsmen will demonstrate pioneer life.  Entertainment is
  provided by local musicians playing traditional bluegrass and gospel selec
 tions.  Food and craft vendors will be onsite also.
