 chestrations on some of his most beloved hits including “Only the Good Die 
 Young\,” “Piano Man\,” “New York State of Mind\,” “You May Be Right\,” “Mov
 in’ Out\,” “My Life\,” and many more. \n\nPack your picnic! Summerfest offe
 rs great music under the stars at Koka Booth Amphitheatre in Cary—and remem
 ber\, kids 12 & under are always admitted free on the lawn!\n\nNorth Caroli
 na SymphonySophie Mok\, conductor Tony DeSare\, vocalist\, piano
