DESCRIPTION:Take a toe-tapping trip through American music history in this 
 brand-new\, world premiere event — where the vintage vibes of Postmodern Ju
 kebox meet the wit of Prairie Home Companion and the electric energy of Sat
 urday Night Live. Music\, memories\, and mayhem — all in one unforgettable 
 show! [PG-13]
