CREATED:20250926T142442Z
DESCRIPTION:<span><br><br><br><p>Please join Engaged Defenders for Democra
 cy on Mondays from 7:30-9 at the corner of Franklin St &amp\; Elliott Rd i
 n Chapel Hill for a weekly\, peaceful\, nonpartisan protest and call to ac
 tion. Free parking at the Church of Reconciliation\, 110 N Elliott Rd.</p>
 <p>Across the political spectrum\, Americans are disillusioned by leaders 
 who put power over people. We gather to build community\, spark hope\, and
  inspire action.</p><p>Bring a friend. Bring a sign. Speak up for immigran
 t rights\, free speech\, healthcare\, social security\, the environment\, 
 the Constitution and the rule of law\, reproductive freedom\, job and fund
 ing cuts\, and the many\, many other issues close to our hearts. Bonus poi
 nts for signs that encourage others to move beyond honking and help turn a
 wareness into action.  We often hand out fliers to stopped cars &amp\; pe
 destrians with information about relevant actions folks can take to suppor
 t their community and defend democracy. We also have a Signal chat for reg
 ular attenders. If you are interested in either of these opportunities\, a
 sk around for Wendy.</p><p>This will be a POSITIVE and nonviolent demonstr
 ation. We are here to protect our democracy. We are standing up for what w
 e believe in. We want to inspire people to join us and grow our movement!<
 /p><p>Please bring positive signs supporting the movement and resisting wh
 at is happening in our country!</p><p>Please no mocking signs\, no swastik
 as</p><p>We are excited to see you there and stand together for our countr
 y!</p><p>See you every Monday afternoon engaging drivers in Chapel Hill!</
 p><p>Please join our Substack:<span> </span><a href="https://substack.com
 /profile/115484101-engaged-defenders-4-democracy">https://substack.com/pro
 file/115484101-engaged-defenders-4-democracy</a></p><p>For more ED4D Mobil
 ize Events:<span> </span><a href="https://www.mobilize.us/engagedefenders
 fordemocracy/">https://www.mobilize.us/engagedefendersfordemocracy/</a></p
 ><a href="https://www.mobilize.us/engagedefendersfordemocracy/event/881591
 /">https://www.mobilize.us/engagedefendersfordemocracy/event/881591/</a></
 span>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260306T223156Z
LOCATION:East Franklin Street & South Elliott Road\, Chapel Hill\, NC\, 27
 514
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-SOURCE:Durham Resistance (In Person)
END:VEVENT
