BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Events 1 Ics": "https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/the-tory-war-9501"}
X-SOURCE-ID:events_1_ics
X-SOURCE:NC Cultural Resources
CATEGORIES:Education Programs,Lectures & Talks
DESCRIPTION:Have you heard of the Tory War? From 1780-81\, Cumberland Count
 y and the surrounding region fell into a civil war between Tories and Patri
 ots during the American Revolution. Learn the stories of courage and horror
  that took place in this formative period in the region's history! \n\nThis
  project was produced with assistance from the America 250 North Carolina i
 nitiative\, administered by the North Carolina Department of Natural and Cu
 ltural Resources. Any opinions\, findings and conclusions or recommendation
 s expressed in this material are those of the author(s) and do not necessar
 ily reflect the views of the State of North Carolina.
DTEND:20260718T180000Z
DTSTAMP:20260407T030457Z
DTSTART:20260718T170000Z
GEO:35.055443;-78.881263
LOCATION:Cumberland County Public Library\, Local & State History Room
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:The Tory War
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_52434796507001
URL:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/the-tory-war-9501
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Events 1 Ics": "https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/discover-tryon-palace-outlander"}
X-SOURCE-ID:events_1_ics
X-SOURCE:NC Cultural Resources
CATEGORIES:Exhibits & Tours,Guided Tours
DESCRIPTION:Step into Tryon Palace and explore Diana Gabaldon’s award-winni
 ng Outlander series. Learn about the lives of the fictional Jamie and Clair
 e Fraser\, their family and friends\, and interactions with historical figu
 res and events in the tumultuous period of the American Revolution.\n\nTour
  covers storylines from Outlander books 4 – 8 and the Starz Outlander seaso
 ns 4 – 8. (For those not current on the books or show\, there will be spoil
 ers for these books and seasons.)\n\nTour begins at 301 George Street\, acr
 oss from the Tryon Palace Main Gates. Ticket holders should check in at the
  Waystation ticketing desk no later than 3:30 p.m.
DTEND:20260718T204500Z
DTSTAMP:20260407T030457Z
DTSTART:20260718T194500Z
GEO:35.104831;-77.043044
LOCATION:Tryon Palace Historic Sites and Gardens
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Discover Tryon Palace: Outlander
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_51931164600076
URL:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/discover-tryon-palace-outlander
END:VEVENT
