BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Events 1 Ics": "https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/ranger-walk-talk"}
X-SOURCE-ID:events_1_ics
X-SOURCE:NC Cultural Resources
CATEGORIES:Education Programs,Lectures & Talks,Outdoor & Recreation,Outdoor
  Recreation (kayak, paddle, hikes),Youth & Family Activities
DESCRIPTION:In honor of World Ranger Day\, join a ranger at Boone Fork Park
 ing Area (milepost 299.9 on the Blue Ridge Parkway) for a short stroll alon
 g the Tanawha Trail. Learn what rangers do on a day-to-day basis\, how we g
 ot our job\, and feel free to ask us questions! This short\, 1/4 mile easy 
 hike ends at a beautiful bridge over the Boone Fork Creek. Feel free to con
 tinue your hike onto Grandfather Mountain State Park trails from here\, or 
 turn around and walk back with the Ranger. \n\nPlease wear appropriate hiki
 ng shoes and dress for the weather.\n\nThere are no bathrooms at Boone Fork
  Parking Area.
DTEND:20260731T183000Z
DTSTAMP:20260407T030457Z
DTSTART:20260731T170000Z
LOCATION:Boone Fork Parking Area
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Ranger Walk & Talk
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_51825563851575
URL:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/ranger-walk-talk
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Events 1 Ics": "https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/spy-training-101-decode-a-secret-message"}
X-SOURCE-ID:events_1_ics
X-SOURCE:NC Cultural Resources
CATEGORIES:Education Programs
DESCRIPTION:Pretend you’ve been recruited as a member of the Culper Spy Rin
 g\, and you need to know how to decipher a message written in invisible ink
 . Supplies include a paint brush\, water\, drying cloth\, vitriol (diluted 
 sulfuric acid)\, Thomas Jefferson cipher and “furnace box.” Read the clues 
 to find the coin with a hidden message\, reveal the message using the brush
  and vitriol\, then use the cipher to decode the message.\n\nContact: Nancy
  Locquet Absillis\, nancy.locquet@naturalsciences.org
DTSTAMP:20260407T030457Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260801
GEO:35.782156;-78.639336
LOCATION:North Carolina Museum of Natural Sciences
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY: Spy Training 101: Decode a Secret Message
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_52504709713652
URL:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/spy-training-101-decode-a-secret-messa
 ge
END:VEVENT
