X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Events 1 Ics": "https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/mourning-in-the-park-in-the-historical-park"}
X-SOURCE-ID:events_1_ics
X-SOURCE:NC Cultural Resources
CATEGORIES:Celebrations & Commemorations,Reenactments & Living History
DESCRIPTION:The American Revolution certainly changed the way people mourne
 d and coped with death. Come learn about the change in mourning practices a
 nd traditions of the country from Colony to Early American Republic. of mou
 rning during and after the war. FREE. All ages welcome. Drop-in.
DTEND:20261017T203000Z
DTSTAMP:20260407T030457Z
DTSTART:20261017T140000Z
