BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Events 1 Ics": "https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/trail-to-victory-the-story-of-kings-mountain"}
X-SOURCE-ID:events_1_ics
X-SOURCE:NC Cultural Resources
CATEGORIES:Celebrations & Commemorations,Reenactments & Living History
DESCRIPTION:Trail to Victory: The Story of Kings Mountain invites you on an
  unforgettable journey through time. Step into the heart of the 1780 Kings 
 Mountain Campaign and witness the pivotal events that shaped the American R
 evolution.\n\nThis immersive museum experience leads you into the heart of 
 the harrowing events leading up to the October 7\, 1780 battle\, places you
  amidst the chaos of the conflict\, and allows you to experience the battle
 's repercussions from the perspectives of both Patriots and British soldier
 s.\n\nJoin us for three museum tours on Saturday\, October 17th\, starting 
 at 12:00 PM\, 1:30 PM\, and 2:30 PM. Tickets are available day of at the Ho
 rn in the West Ticket Office.
DTEND:20261017T190000Z
DTSTAMP:20260407T030457Z
DTSTART:20261017T160000Z
GEO:36.208683;-81.669982
LOCATION:Hickory Ridge History Museum
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Trail to Victory: The Story of Kings Mountain
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_52506317161126
URL:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/trail-to-victory-the-story-of-kings-mo
 untain
END:VEVENT
