X-SOURCE:NC Cultural Resources
CATEGORIES:Celebrations & Commemorations,Reenactments & Living History
DESCRIPTION:Join us as we celebrate Native American Heritage Month with his
 toric foodways! Our costumed interpreters will cook dishes and discuss hist
 oric methods of native cooking. Food samples are unavailable to the public.
  Demonstration only. FREE. All ages welcome. Drop-in.
DTEND:20261114T210000Z
