CATEGORIES:Organizational,Public Meetings,Board & Committee Meetings
DESCRIPTION:Committee will consider proposals for dedicated nature preserve
 s and registered heritage areas.  This regular meeting of the Natural Herit
 age Advisory Committee will be an in-person meeting with a virtual option. 
  Any interested members of the public who wish to participate may contact n
 atural.heritage@dncr.nc.gov to request a meeting link or directions.  The l
 ocation and time for meeting will be determined at a later date.
