X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Calendar 1 Ics": "https://calendar.ncsu.edu/event/2026-safety-trivia-challenge-webinar"}
X-SOURCE-ID:calendar_1_ics
X-SOURCE:NC State University
CATEGORIES:Workshops and Training
DESCRIPTION:Join NC State Industry Extension Services for a fun and interac
 tive webinar packed with Occupational Safety and Health Administration (OSH
 A) trivia. Come test your knowledge of OSHA standards\, regulations and saf
 ety practices in this engaging session designed to challenge and entertain.
  You will compete with fellow safety enthusiasts as you tackle questions ac
 ross a range of topics\, from workplace hazards to compliance requirements.
  This trivia event will be a great way to learn\, connect and brush up on k
 ey safety facts. Don’t miss the chance to have some fun and sharpen your OS
 HA expertise. Sign up today.
DTEND:20261214T160000Z
DTSTAMP:20260407T030232Z
DTSTART:20261214T150000Z
LOCATION:
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:2026 Safety Trivia Challenge 
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_52443202751861
URL:https://calendar.ncsu.edu/event/2026-safety-trivia-challenge-webinar
END:VEVENT
